(4290518, 618162, 68035, '<td valign="top">Gosh this is a hard challenge to mark, especially when you see people that you ''know'' from DPC.  I am a big fan of your SP''s and love the way that you portray yourself in such a variety of poses, from washer woman to something as ''gentle'' as this.  Wonderful full frame shot and I love the compassion that your face (especially the eyes) portrays</td>', 'Gosh this is a hard challenge to mark, especially when you see people that you ''know'' from DPC.  I am a big fan of your SP''s and love the way that you portray yourself in such a variety of poses, from washer woman to something as ''gentle'' as this.  Wonderful full frame shot and I love the compassion that your face (especially the eyes) portrays', '2007-12-05 05:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
