(4290552, 619713, 68035, '<td valign="top">Stunning shot.  Absolutely superb colouring and fantastic sharpness and detail, an image made for me by the eys which seem to tell unspoken tales of many things seen - both good and bad - but which retain a compassion and humanity.<br/> <br/>Brilliant SP.  Good Luck in the challenge</td>', 'Stunning shot.  Absolutely superb colouring and fantastic sharpness and detail, an image made for me by the eys which seem to tell unspoken tales of many things seen - both good and bad - but which retain a compassion and humanity. Brilliant SP.  Good Luck in the challenge', '2007-12-05 06:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
