(4292478, 619411, 36499, '<td valign="top">sorry..I dont know who u are but I have this one picked for the blue. I would like to see this same shot but without the spotlight. I simply LOVE the editing. great work..Ill be checking your port out!</td>', 'sorry..I dont know who u are but I have this one picked for the blue. I would like to see this same shot but without the spotlight. I simply LOVE the editing. great work..Ill be checking your port out!', '2007-12-05 14:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4292479, 619666, 80912, '<td valign="top">I know it''s the "in" thing to do to chop of part of the head, but it bugs me here - especially the ear, but the top of the hair, too. If you had cropped down near the eyebrows, it might have been better. Really too bad, because the rest of it (the eyes, the colors, etc.) is fantastic.</td>', 'I know it''s the "in" thing to do to chop of part of the head, but it bugs me here - especially the ear, but the top of the hair, too. If you had cropped down near the eyebrows, it might have been better. Really too bad, because the rest of it (the eyes, the colors, etc.) is fantastic.', '2007-12-05 14:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4292480, 619731, 52500, '<td valign="top">Nice one, Andrew!  You are the SP master.  I''m usually not a fan of selective desat, but you totally made it work here.  How you come up with so many unique and refreshing ways to portray yourself is beyond me.  Great job!</td>', 'Nice one, Andrew!  You are the SP master.  I''m usually not a fan of selective desat, but you totally made it work here.  How you come up with so many unique and refreshing ways to portray yourself is beyond me.  Great job!', '2007-12-05 14:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4292484, 617905, 5112, '<td valign="top">He, he, the eyes are the windows to the soul, but these eyes, they are hiding behind real windows, like, "I don''t <i>really</i> want you to know who I am".<br/> <br/>Came back.  This image is haunting.  Deb, right?  Without meaning any offense whatsoever, I wish there were more texture to the face; the skin, with the wrinkles and imperfections, is beautiful, and I would like to see it up front, no softening whatsoever, just the natural beauty that it is.  The soft, shiny, dark scarf is the perfect contrast to the skin.  I wish there was just a smidgeon more room at left (so that the end of the eye area were not cut off and the face shape would have a slightly more upward swing), and I wish the background were not as dull (some sort of texture or something out of focus there).  ~9</td>', 'He, he, the eyes are the windows to the soul, but these eyes, they are hiding behind real windows, like, "I don''t really want you to know who I am". Came back.  This image is haunting.  Deb, right?  Without meaning any offense whatsoever, I wish there were more texture to the face; the skin, with the wrinkles and imperfections, is beautiful, and I would like to see it up front, no softening whatsoever, just the natural beauty that it is.  The soft, shiny, dark scarf is the perfect contrast to the skin.  I wish there was just a smidgeon more room at left (so that the end of the eye area were not cut off and the face shape would have a slightly more upward swing), and I wish the background were not as dull (some sort of texture or something out of focus there).  ~9', '2007-12-05 14:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4292489, 619367, 83600, '<td valign="top">lol nice</td>', 'lol nice', '2007-12-05 14:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4292490, 619849, 5112, '<td valign="top">Well, it doesn''t show :)</td>', 'Well, it doesn''t show :)', '2007-12-05 14:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4292493, 619367, 18583, '<td valign="top">This is hilarious!  I laughed out loud when I saw this...brilliant, I tell you, brilliant...wish I could see the teeth a bit more, though...</td>', 'This is hilarious!  I laughed out loud when I saw this...brilliant, I tell you, brilliant...wish I could see the teeth a bit more, though...', '2007-12-05 14:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
