(4292587, 619554, 80912, '<td valign="top">You look a bit well dressed for your surroundings, lol. More like a lost tourist than a derelict. (Unless, of course, there''s a joke here I''m just not getting)<br/> <br/>But as for the photography, your face and shirt seem to be the wrong color - as if desaturated or blued.I like the composition and the setting, lighting is good, but could use a bit more contrast.</td>', 'You look a bit well dressed for your surroundings, lol. More like a lost tourist than a derelict. (Unless, of course, there''s a joke here I''m just not getting) But as for the photography, your face and shirt seem to be the wrong color - as if desaturated or blued.I like the composition and the setting, lighting is good, but could use a bit more contrast.', '2007-12-05 14:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4292593, 619621, 36499, '<td valign="top">ROFLMAO! this is definately a time when size matters! tooo funny! love the added glow</td>', 'ROFLMAO! this is definately a time when size matters! tooo funny! love the added glow', '2007-12-05 14:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
