(4292611, 619890, 35994, '<td valign="top">I like how you made the eyes on the shirt glow a little bit, like the "inner you" is coming out. I think the lighting works well overall.</td>', 'I like how you made the eyes on the shirt glow a little bit, like the "inner you" is coming out. I think the lighting works well overall.', '2007-12-05 14:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4292616, 618288, 32378, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting in this a lot the way your hair is highlighted.  I also like how this says something about you.</td>', 'I like the lighting in this a lot the way your hair is highlighted.  I also like how this says something about you.', '2007-12-05 14:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4292620, 619825, 35994, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting &amp; the sunset in the background, only thing I find a little distracting is the sunset on the right side of the photo, I might''ve cloned along the top to make it left like it is on the right. Just my 2 cents though :)</td>', 'I like the lighting & the sunset in the background, only thing I find a little distracting is the sunset on the right side of the photo, I might''ve cloned along the top to make it left like it is on the right. Just my 2 cents though :)', '2007-12-05 14:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4292624, 618741, 32378, '<td valign="top">I like the softness of this, the color in the eyes and the close crop.</td>', 'I like the softness of this, the color in the eyes and the close crop.', '2007-12-05 14:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4292631, 619621, 32378, '<td valign="top">I like the hummor of this on so many levels.  Shows your passion for photography but you can also laugh at yourself.  good luck.</td>', 'I like the hummor of this on so many levels.  Shows your passion for photography but you can also laugh at yourself.  good luck.', '2007-12-05 14:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4292636, 618945, 32378, '<td valign="top">I like what this tells me about you.  I like the tones that you used.  good luck.</td>', 'I like what this tells me about you.  I like the tones that you used.  good luck.', '2007-12-05 14:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4292647, 619715, 32378, '<td valign="top">For me the books are a little to dominate in this shot and seem to pull me away from you.</td>', 'For me the books are a little to dominate in this shot and seem to pull me away from you.', '2007-12-05 14:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4292648, 619941, 45631, '<td valign="top">I like this image but the processing has taken a bit of the character out of it (or so it seems to me).  Nose tends to blend into face a bit and seems too smooth under the left eye.  Back to bump this up as I really love the pose and gaze on this shot.</td>', 'I like this image but the processing has taken a bit of the character out of it (or so it seems to me).  Nose tends to blend into face a bit and seems too smooth under the left eye.  Back to bump this up as I really love the pose and gaze on this shot.', '2007-12-05 14:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4292649, 618988, 80912, '<td valign="top">You should have worn a plain shirt - the design on it is very distracting.</td>', 'You should have worn a plain shirt - the design on it is very distracting.', '2007-12-05 14:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4292656, 619254, 32378, '<td valign="top">I felt I need to see more of you in this shot, the shot tells me more about the inside of the car than the driver.</td>', 'I felt I need to see more of you in this shot, the shot tells me more about the inside of the car than the driver.', '2007-12-05 14:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4292659, 619846, 80912, '<td valign="top">I didn''t know the Invisible Man was on DPC! But I think it would have been better w/ the hat in better focus rather than the cutain.</td>', 'I didn''t know the Invisible Man was on DPC! But I think it would have been better w/ the hat in better focus rather than the cutain.', '2007-12-05 14:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
