(4292668, 619099, 45631, '<td valign="top">I like this image with the sharp eye peering through the mask.  Would have liked a bit more white on the mask to create more contrast.</td>', 'I like this image with the sharp eye peering through the mask.  Would have liked a bit more white on the mask to create more contrast.', '2007-12-05 14:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
