(4294535, 617960, 5112, '<td valign="top">Lovely, just lovely, AlanInPink!  Pink suits you, and it contrasts beautifully with the blue eyes, tie, and background (although a touch of rouge/lipstick to match the pink would have perfected it).  And the gray hair makes it look so dignified!<br/> <br/>I should get serious.  As a self-portrait, I think this is quite good, and one of the best entries.  It is a nice "traditional" presentation, yet it has funk, and shows (I think) quite a bit of your character.  I really like it.  (10)</td>', 'Lovely, just lovely, AlanInPink!  Pink suits you, and it contrasts beautifully with the blue eyes, tie, and background (although a touch of rouge/lipstick to match the pink would have perfected it).  And the gray hair makes it look so dignified! I should get serious.  As a self-portrait, I think this is quite good, and one of the best entries.  It is a nice "traditional" presentation, yet it has funk, and shows (I think) quite a bit of your character.  I really like it.  (10)', '2007-12-05 23:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
