(4295707, 618341, 77838, '<td valign="top">The black strap over your shoulder is a little distracting.  Maybe without it you would give the viewer a sense of "wondering".  <br/>Ok, that sounds bad.  I don''t mean that at all, I''m just saying it''s a dark contrast line.  I like the expression on your face!</td>', 'The black strap over your shoulder is a little distracting.  Maybe without it you would give the viewer a sense of "wondering".  Ok, that sounds bad.  I don''t mean that at all, I''m just saying it''s a dark contrast line.  I like the expression on your face!', '2007-12-06 11:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4295708, 618715, 39679, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but the depth of field is just a tad too small and everything below your nose is out of focus.  Still an interesting study.</td>', 'Nice shot but the depth of field is just a tad too small and everything below your nose is out of focus.  Still an interesting study.', '2007-12-06 11:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
