(4297227, 617960, 80058, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe you beat MY hat!!!!!!!! =p I love the super traditional set up great expression and super dooper cool and colour hat adds a great twist to the tradional idea lol</td>', 'I can''t believe you beat MY hat!!!!!!!! =p I love the super traditional set up great expression and super dooper cool and colour hat adds a great twist to the tradional idea lol', '2007-12-06 20:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297228, 617703, 80058, '<td valign="top">Cute!! Nice use of negative space, think the selective saturation works I somehow think a bump in contrast would give this a boost!</td>', 'Cute!! Nice use of negative space, think the selective saturation works I somehow think a bump in contrast would give this a boost!', '2007-12-06 20:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297229, 619843, 80058, '<td valign="top">Altho your jumper is more in focus than your face, which happens as I can see you turned the camera around and shot =) I like this a great deal, the background is sooooooooo lovely, I like the fact you made this very personal by going to your fave place... very nice and warm smile as well completes the shot for me <br/> <br/>Best of luck 7</td>', 'Altho your jumper is more in focus than your face, which happens as I can see you turned the camera around and shot =) I like this a great deal, the background is sooooooooo lovely, I like the fact you made this very personal by going to your fave place... very nice and warm smile as well completes the shot for me  Best of luck 7', '2007-12-06 20:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297230, 619355, 80058, '<td valign="top">Wow some1 misses summer!!!!!!! hahahahaha Dude I feel cold for you! Brrrrrrrr, it''s a nice idea but, I don''t know I wish there was also a beach ball and more colourful props that we usually take to the beach. Very brave shot tho!!!</td>', 'Wow some1 misses summer!!!!!!! hahahahaha Dude I feel cold for you! Brrrrrrrr, it''s a nice idea but, I don''t know I wish there was also a beach ball and more colourful props that we usually take to the beach. Very brave shot tho!!!', '2007-12-06 20:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297232, 619858, 80058, '<td valign="top">Hehehehe I like this to the point where you captured a candid moment you always go through =) just not so sure about the filters you used on this <br/> <br/>good luck</td>', 'Hehehehe I like this to the point where you captured a candid moment you always go through =) just not so sure about the filters you used on this  good luck', '2007-12-06 20:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297236, 618993, 45631, '<td valign="top">You have an interesting face but you have taken a shot which leaves it quite blank. A slight smile, an envious look or something to give the shot character would have helped.  Don''t think the hat helps here - maybe would have gone with a colorful bandana or a cap on in the reverse, something with a bit more punch to it that adds to the portrait. Lighting is ok but skin colors are way out.  The pose could be improved by being on a bit more of an angle (turn your shoulders a bit more) and also leaving a bit more room to your right.  Phew, think I need a cuppa now.  lol  Hope that helps :)</td>', 'You have an interesting face but you have taken a shot which leaves it quite blank. A slight smile, an envious look or something to give the shot character would have helped.  Don''t think the hat helps here - maybe would have gone with a colorful bandana or a cap on in the reverse, something with a bit more punch to it that adds to the portrait. Lighting is ok but skin colors are way out.  The pose could be improved by being on a bit more of an angle (turn your shoulders a bit more) and also leaving a bit more room to your right.  Phew, think I need a cuppa now.  lol  Hope that helps :)', '2007-12-06 20:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297238, 619619, 80058, '<td valign="top">Ohhhh, from the thumbnail I thought it would be 1 of my faves simply because I love low angle shots... I love the backgound you used here, the colours are to my taste and it''s so cool, like I was saying I love low angle shots and I like that you took that approach but the fact that you is out of focus lets me down big time... then again it''s understandable why its oof as you cant view it on the viewfinder, so 6 from me but would have been a 10 if you was in focus as well =)<br/> <br/>Best of luck!!!!!!</td>', 'Ohhhh, from the thumbnail I thought it would be 1 of my faves simply because I love low angle shots... I love the backgound you used here, the colours are to my taste and it''s so cool, like I was saying I love low angle shots and I like that you took that approach but the fact that you is out of focus lets me down big time... then again it''s understandable why its oof as you cant view it on the viewfinder, so 6 from me but would have been a 10 if you was in focus as well =) Best of luck!!!!!!', '2007-12-06 20:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297264, 618008, 80058, '<td valign="top">I think this is a fun shot! hehehe</td>', 'I think this is a fun shot! hehehe', '2007-12-06 20:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
