(4297419, 619731, 87469, '<td valign="top">i really feel like this does not feel like a ''true'' portrait due to the fact of how your holding the ball...It would had been really cool without the ball and with just your face instead to tell the story. Because a good majority of the color is in that ball, you want to focus on that and also the fact that your holding it up and really close to your face.</td>', 'i really feel like this does not feel like a ''true'' portrait due to the fact of how your holding the ball...It would had been really cool without the ball and with just your face instead to tell the story. Because a good majority of the color is in that ball, you want to focus on that and also the fact that your holding it up and really close to your face.', '2007-12-06 21:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297421, 617703, 41914, '<td valign="top">I like what you were going for here. but it''s just not convincing .</td>', 'I like what you were going for here. but it''s just not convincing .', '2007-12-06 21:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297424, 619554, 41914, '<td valign="top">Great tone to this image</td>', 'Great tone to this image', '2007-12-06 21:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297426, 619406, 87469, '<td valign="top">really good. I like how everything works in the photograph with the DOF. Also how your eyes pop out and it does not look like it was photoshoped to pop out. My only problem is with the backdrop and how you can tell it is fabric. A good way to fix this is to use white seemless paper or really tightening the fabric out and taping it down.<br/> <br/>Reguardless i think this is pretty good but could use some work.</td>', 'really good. I like how everything works in the photograph with the DOF. Also how your eyes pop out and it does not look like it was photoshoped to pop out. My only problem is with the backdrop and how you can tell it is fabric. A good way to fix this is to use white seemless paper or really tightening the fabric out and taping it down. Reguardless i think this is pretty good but could use some work.', '2007-12-06 21:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297429, 618843, 87469, '<td valign="top">Cool idea for a portrait. But work on trying to make yourself stand out a little more. The photograph itself looks really flat and because of this, its not really popping out to me.<br/> <br/>Either way, good idea.</td>', 'Cool idea for a portrait. But work on trying to make yourself stand out a little more. The photograph itself looks really flat and because of this, its not really popping out to me. Either way, good idea.', '2007-12-06 21:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297431, 619411, 72670, '<td valign="top">I really like the processing here. I hope you post the steps.The only thing I don''t like is the bottom light. Good work!</td>', 'I really like the processing here. I hope you post the steps.The only thing I don''t like is the bottom light. Good work!', '2007-12-06 21:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297432, 619843, 72670, '<td valign="top">Hey I know this man! Finally someone I know. I like the perspective. And of course that tree..how can you not like that tree.High marks! Oh wait its not about the tree. Back down it goes. Sorry man!:)</td>', 'Hey I know this man! Finally someone I know. I like the perspective. And of course that tree..how can you not like that tree.High marks! Oh wait its not about the tree. Back down it goes. Sorry man!:)', '2007-12-06 21:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297435, 619365, 39110, '<td valign="top">Is this really you?</td>', 'Is this really you?', '2007-12-06 21:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297436, 617883, 87469, '<td valign="top">Nice crop of the fact and the face is lit very well. Try making the photo pop a little in photoshop not only in the eyes but in the lips and what she is wearing.</td>', 'Nice crop of the fact and the face is lit very well. Try making the photo pop a little in photoshop not only in the eyes but in the lips and what she is wearing.', '2007-12-06 21:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297437, 619639, 41914, '<td valign="top">I would expect this image to ribbon</td>', 'I would expect this image to ribbon', '2007-12-06 21:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297439, 619843, 87469, '<td valign="top">Really nice...you have a lot of things popping out, like the hat and your face. Also how the background is outside is nice and how it works to help you, yourself pop out. <br/> <br/>My one problem is that it looks like a myspace photo cause it looks like you just turned the camera around and took a photo of yourself. <br/> <br/>The photo looks like it was processed very well though.</td>', 'Really nice...you have a lot of things popping out, like the hat and your face. Also how the background is outside is nice and how it works to help you, yourself pop out.  My one problem is that it looks like a myspace photo cause it looks like you just turned the camera around and took a photo of yourself.  The photo looks like it was processed very well though.', '2007-12-06 21:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297446, 619715, 87469, '<td valign="top">Its a nice photo because it tells a story about you. Its really pushing the idea of a self portrait to by adding a little bit of you in it, which is your eye. Which is really a special part of the body cause its through our eyes that we can make out what the world is, so would that make our eyes, who we are?<br/> <br/>I don''t know, but good use of putting yourself in the frame somewhere and having yourself stick out because of it. I just am not a big fan of the over-sharpening. Mainly because of my own reasons, but it is a good photo.</td>', 'Its a nice photo because it tells a story about you. Its really pushing the idea of a self portrait to by adding a little bit of you in it, which is your eye. Which is really a special part of the body cause its through our eyes that we can make out what the world is, so would that make our eyes, who we are? I don''t know, but good use of putting yourself in the frame somewhere and having yourself stick out because of it. I just am not a big fan of the over-sharpening. Mainly because of my own reasons, but it is a good photo.', '2007-12-06 21:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297451, 619785, 41914, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image, everything about this is good. 8 . I hope this ribbons.</td>', 'Wonderful image, everything about this is good. 8 . I hope this ribbons.', '2007-12-06 21:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297452, 619493, 87469, '<td valign="top">Way to go with popping your eyes out and composing yourself...problem is the photo is extermly flat...to much grays and blacks, try to make your cheeks pop out by dodging them or something...or dodging your shirt. The photo just feels dead but you have a good idea on how to make it work.</td>', 'Way to go with popping your eyes out and composing yourself...problem is the photo is extermly flat...to much grays and blacks, try to make your cheeks pop out by dodging them or something...or dodging your shirt. The photo just feels dead but you have a good idea on how to make it work.', '2007-12-06 21:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297454, 619908, 87469, '<td valign="top">Nice even portrait. Good job!</td>', 'Nice even portrait. Good job!', '2007-12-06 21:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297456, 618022, 87469, '<td valign="top">Where are you?</td>', 'Where are you?', '2007-12-06 21:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297460, 619445, 87469, '<td valign="top">I extremly like the use of DOF in this photograph and how you did the process and post on this image. Also like how you popped your eyes out and used the dirt to tale a story about yourself. <br/> <br/>A+</td>', 'I extremly like the use of DOF in this photograph and how you did the process and post on this image. Also like how you popped your eyes out and used the dirt to tale a story about yourself.  A+', '2007-12-06 21:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297461, 619791, 41914, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors in this I wish the skates were cleaner 6</td>', 'Wonderful colors in this I wish the skates were cleaner 6', '2007-12-06 21:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297465, 619886, 87469, '<td valign="top">Nice pose and lighting on yourself...just use a different background because with the experession on your face and the background, i feel like they clash with each other. I know its easy to use black and white but try to mix it up with some color, cause another problem is that you lose yourself (your arm and body) in the backdrop also.<br/> <br/>Anyway, you did nice with the lighting and popping your eyes out.</td>', 'Nice pose and lighting on yourself...just use a different background because with the experession on your face and the background, i feel like they clash with each other. I know its easy to use black and white but try to mix it up with some color, cause another problem is that you lose yourself (your arm and body) in the backdrop also. Anyway, you did nice with the lighting and popping your eyes out.', '2007-12-06 21:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297472, 619207, 87469, '<td valign="top">Really nice photo but your eyes are TOO much...<br/> <br/>take it down some and make it match yourself and you''ll have something nice.</td>', 'Really nice photo but your eyes are TOO much... take it down some and make it match yourself and you''ll have something nice.', '2007-12-06 21:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
