(4297476, 619787, 41914, '<td valign="top">I''ve been looking at this image for a while now. It has captivated me. Its very reminiscent of Herb Ritts''s photo of Jack Nicholson. I am not a fan of a photo that involves Photoshop to make it happen. I give you 6 a 7 or 8 if it was all color or all b/w great tones and idea.</td>', 'I''ve been looking at this image for a while now. It has captivated me. Its very reminiscent of Herb Ritts''s photo of Jack Nicholson. I am not a fan of a photo that involves Photoshop to make it happen. I give you 6 a 7 or 8 if it was all color or all b/w great tones and idea.', '2007-12-06 21:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
