(4298121, 619379, 49578, '<td valign="top">The composition is interesting, but flash from front makes the whole picture flat</td>', 'The composition is interesting, but flash from front makes the whole picture flat', '2007-12-07 01:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4298122, 619849, 49578, '<td valign="top">ha ha!! nice portrait, looks very natural</td>', 'ha ha!! nice portrait, looks very natural', '2007-12-07 01:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4298123, 619045, 49578, '<td valign="top">THe foreground silhouette almost looks like you have painted it black. Kinda artificial.</td>', 'THe foreground silhouette almost looks like you have painted it black. Kinda artificial.', '2007-12-07 01:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4298124, 618510, 49578, '<td valign="top">unusual perspective!</td>', 'unusual perspective!', '2007-12-07 01:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4298142, 618243, 67237, '<td valign="top">Enzo, this is a great work from the technical point of view. Let me guess how you did it under advanced editing rules: All little Enzo''s are in one printed photograph that was previously worked out with multiple exposures in black bg combined in PS; its upper border was cutout. Then you placed it in front of you...played a bit with DOF and bang!! <br/> <br/>Anyway I can`t wait to read the insides of the making of it. As far as the composition I would have liked it better if your eyes were not crossed by the border of your glasses, but i assume you had to tilt down the glasses to avoid the reflection of your lighting. A little more variety of expresions would also add :-). lol<br/> <br/> <br/>I hope you do very well with this image..you get a 9 from me</td>', 'Enzo, this is a great work from the technical point of view. Let me guess how you did it under advanced editing rules: All little Enzo''s are in one printed photograph that was previously worked out with multiple exposures in black bg combined in PS; its upper border was cutout. Then you placed it in front of you...played a bit with DOF and bang!!  Anyway I can`t wait to read the insides of the making of it. As far as the composition I would have liked it better if your eyes were not crossed by the border of your glasses, but i assume you had to tilt down the glasses to avoid the reflection of your lighting. A little more variety of expresions would also add :-). lol  I hope you do very well with this image..you get a 9 from me', '2007-12-07 02:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4298143, 619689, 67237, '<td valign="top">one of favs in this challenge...excellent angle, exposure, processing, all added to natural expression. I like the texture of the wood behind and the desat.<br/> <br/>The vigneting also works here but it could have been a bit more subtle.  Congratulations and best of luck!!</td>', 'one of favs in this challenge...excellent angle, exposure, processing, all added to natural expression. I like the texture of the wood behind and the desat. The vigneting also works here but it could have been a bit more subtle.  Congratulations and best of luck!!', '2007-12-07 02:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
