(4298341, 619377, 48389, '<td valign="top">My dear Mambe, you blow me away with your wonderful self portraits! The natural beauty you posses shines through in this image and the ''technicals'' are spot on. I like your placement in the rule of thirds and the use of all white accept the scarf is excellent. Mambe, I admire you for entering this challenge, it''s certainly something I could never do. I hope to see you on the front page with this shot as it''s one of my favourite in the challenge! My love and {{HUGS}} to you x</td>', 'My dear Mambe, you blow me away with your wonderful self portraits! The natural beauty you posses shines through in this image and the ''technicals'' are spot on. I like your placement in the rule of thirds and the use of all white accept the scarf is excellent. Mambe, I admire you for entering this challenge, it''s certainly something I could never do. I hope to see you on the front page with this shot as it''s one of my favourite in the challenge! My love and {{HUGS}} to you x', '2007-12-07 06:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
