(4299494, 618300, 58785, '<td valign="top">I am not sure why didn''t you put color version of your head there. I think it would do much better. bw is ok too but it stays a bit dark. A very good idea and I like the composition. Framing is nice. I would like to see a color faced version after the challenge is over :)</td>', 'I am not sure why didn''t you put color version of your head there. I think it would do much better. bw is ok too but it stays a bit dark. A very good idea and I like the composition. Framing is nice. I would like to see a color faced version after the challenge is over :)', '2007-12-07 16:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299503, 619716, 58785, '<td valign="top">A very pretty face. Good composition. Nice makeup. One thing bothers me in this photo is the softness. If you''d have better focus, or little sharp eyes, or better yet, colored eyes and rest bw... you probably would go through my brain like laser :) right now, it bounces back from my forehead :) Show us some color eyes after the challenge is over please :)</td>', 'A very pretty face. Good composition. Nice makeup. One thing bothers me in this photo is the softness. If you''d have better focus, or little sharp eyes, or better yet, colored eyes and rest bw... you probably would go through my brain like laser :) right now, it bounces back from my forehead :) Show us some color eyes after the challenge is over please :)', '2007-12-07 16:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299508, 619850, 58785, '<td valign="top">Nice... not much going on. I like the mirror frame idea. and also bw works well. Good positioning in the frame. The camera seems like left in the dark, and I think I would like to see more of it... a bit more. Overall is a good portrait photo though ;)</td>', 'Nice... not much going on. I like the mirror frame idea. and also bw works well. Good positioning in the frame. The camera seems like left in the dark, and I think I would like to see more of it... a bit more. Overall is a good portrait photo though ;)', '2007-12-07 16:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299513, 619713, 58785, '<td valign="top">There is definitely a story on this face. Very sharp, nice colors. I like it overall.</td>', 'There is definitely a story on this face. Very sharp, nice colors. I like it overall.', '2007-12-07 16:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299515, 618909, 22689, '<td valign="top">You look nicer than Jean Reno (have you seen him in Nikita ? or his terrific profile in The big blue ?) <br/>A very nice photo !</td>', 'You look nicer than Jean Reno (have you seen him in Nikita ? or his terrific profile in The big blue ?) A very nice photo !', '2007-12-07 16:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299518, 618920, 58785, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, idea. It''s a very cool photo but I prefer to see your face, at least part of it, not the shadow. I don''t cut too much if DNMC, so don''t worry a bout that. I think you have the photographer''s. Next time, please show a little face :)</td>', 'I like the composition, idea. It''s a very cool photo but I prefer to see your face, at least part of it, not the shadow. I don''t cut too much if DNMC, so don''t worry a bout that. I think you have the photographer''s. Next time, please show a little face :)', '2007-12-07 16:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299519, 619843, 22689, '<td valign="top">A very honest photo and what a wonderful background !</td>', 'A very honest photo and what a wonderful background !', '2007-12-07 16:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299528, 619825, 67343, '<td valign="top">Nice sp, like your horse to bad you did not get more of that pretty sky in your background.</td>', 'Nice sp, like your horse to bad you did not get more of that pretty sky in your background.', '2007-12-07 16:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299545, 617905, 61222, '<td valign="top">Good title. Eyes are awesome!!</td>', 'Good title. Eyes are awesome!!', '2007-12-07 16:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
