(4299552, 618203, 61222, '<td valign="top">cool</td>', 'cool', '2007-12-07 16:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299559, 618243, 61222, '<td valign="top">Is that a big picture of you behind you?? Great idea and image.</td>', 'Is that a big picture of you behind you?? Great idea and image.', '2007-12-07 16:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299569, 619709, 61222, '<td valign="top">Great idea and image.</td>', 'Great idea and image.', '2007-12-07 16:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299576, 619960, 80588, '<td valign="top">Great title~</td>', 'Great title~', '2007-12-07 17:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299578, 619788, 22689, '<td valign="top">Very sexy !<br/>Good lighting , the effect in the background is cool.<br/>my vote 8</td>', 'Very sexy !Good lighting , the effect in the background is cool.my vote 8', '2007-12-07 17:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299591, 619450, 61222, '<td valign="top">Really a great image, but I don''t like the stick behind your head. 8</td>', 'Really a great image, but I don''t like the stick behind your head. 8', '2007-12-07 17:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299597, 617960, 61222, '<td valign="top">Cute hat ;-P !! Great image and so brave.</td>', 'Cute hat ;-P !! Great image and so brave.', '2007-12-07 17:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299612, 619084, 61222, '<td valign="top">Great image:-)</td>', 'Great image:-)', '2007-12-07 17:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299613, 617838, 80588, '<td valign="top">You''re gorgeous!</td>', 'You''re gorgeous!', '2007-12-07 17:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299644, 619791, 61222, '<td valign="top">Great image cute and colorful with great lighting.</td>', 'Great image cute and colorful with great lighting.', '2007-12-07 17:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299645, 619885, 61222, '<td valign="top">Gotta love it.</td>', 'Gotta love it.', '2007-12-07 17:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299661, 619788, 77838, '<td valign="top">Nice shallow DOF.  I like how your necklace is just out of focus and your face/eyes are sharp and clear.</td>', 'Nice shallow DOF.  I like how your necklace is just out of focus and your face/eyes are sharp and clear.', '2007-12-07 17:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299663, 619554, 77838, '<td valign="top">Nice pose, with your head tipped down just a bit.  It gives me the feel of someone that''s a little camera shy.  I like the graffiti also.</td>', 'Nice pose, with your head tipped down just a bit.  It gives me the feel of someone that''s a little camera shy.  I like the graffiti also.', '2007-12-07 17:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299666, 619960, 77838, '<td valign="top">Interesting shadows here and I''m a big fan of off camera lighting.  Definitely the way to go.   Nicely done.  BB</td>', 'Interesting shadows here and I''m a big fan of off camera lighting.  Definitely the way to go.   Nicely done.  BB', '2007-12-07 17:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299674, 619561, 77838, '<td valign="top">This almost  feels like a ''high key'' image with the bright light on your arms and face.  Good use of secondary light use.  BB  <br/> <br/>PS. I mean ''seconday'' in that it''s not the main on camera flash.</td>', 'This almost  feels like a ''high key'' image with the bright light on your arms and face.  Good use of secondary light use.  BB   PS. I mean ''seconday'' in that it''s not the main on camera flash.', '2007-12-07 17:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299677, 618510, 77838, '<td valign="top">Nice under-lighting!  It really accents the whites in your eyes.</td>', 'Nice under-lighting!  It really accents the whites in your eyes.', '2007-12-07 17:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299683, 619944, 77838, '<td valign="top">I''m glad you kept your eyes in focus.  The rest of your face and neck seem to just gently fade out of the frame.  Excellent ''high key'' lighting; nicely done.  BB</td>', 'I''m glad you kept your eyes in focus.  The rest of your face and neck seem to just gently fade out of the frame.  Excellent ''high key'' lighting; nicely done.  BB', '2007-12-07 17:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299729, 619714, 65035, '<td valign="top">This is lovely, composition and your expression are really nice.</td>', 'This is lovely, composition and your expression are really nice.', '2007-12-07 18:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299738, 618920, 65035, '<td valign="top">A cool idea and nice composition. There''s a few little spots that are distracting tough, maybe you could have swept or cloned them out to give a cleaner look.</td>', 'A cool idea and nice composition. There''s a few little spots that are distracting tough, maybe you could have swept or cloned them out to give a cleaner look.', '2007-12-07 18:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299747, 619517, 65035, '<td valign="top">Nice pose, I love the guitar case. I''m finding the brightness a little at odds with the rocker look.</td>', 'Nice pose, I love the guitar case. I''m finding the brightness a little at odds with the rocker look.', '2007-12-07 18:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299756, 618696, 65035, '<td valign="top">Wheeeeeeee you look like you''re having fun, love the colours. A little bit sharper would be nice especially on your eyes.</td>', 'Wheeeeeeee you look like you''re having fun, love the colours. A little bit sharper would be nice especially on your eyes.', '2007-12-07 18:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299758, 619951, 77838, '<td valign="top">Your mouth and eyes'' expressions give me the feeling as if you were sitting at a railroad station just waiting on a son or family member to come rolling right in!  The sepia tones make it feel as if this setting where happening ''back in the day''.  I like it alot.  BB</td>', 'Your mouth and eyes'' expressions give me the feeling as if you were sitting at a railroad station just waiting on a son or family member to come rolling right in!  The sepia tones make it feel as if this setting where happening ''back in the day''.  I like it alot.  BB', '2007-12-07 18:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299776, 619159, 65035, '<td valign="top">I love this you look like a Greek Goddess.</td>', 'I love this you look like a Greek Goddess.', '2007-12-07 18:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299790, 619854, 65035, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is a powerful image the expression on your face is made all the more poignant by the coloured lights. The composition is superb.</td>', 'Wow, this is a powerful image the expression on your face is made all the more poignant by the coloured lights. The composition is superb.', '2007-12-07 18:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299794, 618945, 65035, '<td valign="top">Clever, I like it a lot. The tones are lovely.</td>', 'Clever, I like it a lot. The tones are lovely.', '2007-12-07 18:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299804, 619636, 77838, '<td valign="top">Your overall lighting is a little too dark for me.  And the pose itself doesn''t suggest very much enthusiasm or action (unless that''s what you were going for).  BB</td>', 'Your overall lighting is a little too dark for me.  And the pose itself doesn''t suggest very much enthusiasm or action (unless that''s what you were going for).  BB', '2007-12-07 18:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299805, 619547, 65035, '<td valign="top">This is awesome! I love how you''ve managed to blend all your faces into one. The lighting is great and I like the texture, oh I just love of it ok, a great abstract portrait.</td>', 'This is awesome! I love how you''ve managed to blend all your faces into one. The lighting is great and I like the texture, oh I just love of it ok, a great abstract portrait.', '2007-12-07 18:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299807, 619810, 65035, '<td valign="top">Cool idea, you''ve pulled it off well with the blank expression.</td>', 'Cool idea, you''ve pulled it off well with the blank expression.', '2007-12-07 18:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299813, 617887, 77838, '<td valign="top">The lighting on your cheeks is a bit harsh for me; maybe bumping up your aperture setting or upping your shutter speed would help.  Your eyes appear to be half asleep also.  BB</td>', 'The lighting on your cheeks is a bit harsh for me; maybe bumping up your aperture setting or upping your shutter speed would help.  Your eyes appear to be half asleep also.  BB', '2007-12-07 18:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299819, 617905, 65035, '<td valign="top">Oooooooooo I love the windows reflected in the "windows to the soul" very well done. Oh I love the rest of it to, colour, composition, just love it.</td>', 'Oooooooooo I love the windows reflected in the "windows to the soul" very well done. Oh I love the rest of it to, colour, composition, just love it.', '2007-12-07 18:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299820, 619852, 77838, '<td valign="top">I think with your red border you could have benefited from a single frame image centered in your photo.  It''s a little dark overall except the BRIGHT spots on your cheeks and forehead.  BB</td>', 'I think with your red border you could have benefited from a single frame image centered in your photo.  It''s a little dark overall except the BRIGHT spots on your cheeks and forehead.  BB', '2007-12-07 18:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299836, 619849, 80896, '<td valign="top">you get an extra point because the title really suits your expression.</td>', 'you get an extra point because the title really suits your expression.', '2007-12-07 18:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299844, 619956, 47483, '<td valign="top">After a long voting , finally a portrait I could call portrait. Loved every pixel of it.</td>', 'After a long voting , finally a portrait I could call portrait. Loved every pixel of it.', '2007-12-07 18:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299854, 619890, 80896, '<td valign="top">i''m to scared to give you a lower score...just joking.great shot.</td>', 'i''m to scared to give you a lower score...just joking.great shot.', '2007-12-07 18:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299857, 619921, 77838, '<td valign="top">You''ve added enough texture effects that you''ve almost lost all detail to th image.  The flash is fairly bright but not enough to totally harm the photo.  I''m not a big fan of this type of image but that''s not to say that others don''t love it!  Nice shooting.  BB</td>', 'You''ve added enough texture effects that you''ve almost lost all detail to th image.  The flash is fairly bright but not enough to totally harm the photo.  I''m not a big fan of this type of image but that''s not to say that others don''t love it!  Nice shooting.  BB', '2007-12-07 18:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299858, 619827, 56417, '<td valign="top">I really like this....</td>', 'I really like this....', '2007-12-07 18:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299860, 618162, 56417, '<td valign="top">nice detail and colors....love your eyes...; )</td>', 'nice detail and colors....love your eyes...; )', '2007-12-07 18:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299864, 618697, 56417, '<td valign="top">extraordinary photo....</td>', 'extraordinary photo....', '2007-12-07 18:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299865, 618028, 77838, '<td valign="top">You should have shot this photo about 8 stops lower on the shutter OR aperture settings.  I think your only problem here is just it''s too dark.  BB</td>', 'You should have shot this photo about 8 stops lower on the shutter OR aperture settings.  I think your only problem here is just it''s too dark.  BB', '2007-12-07 18:38:34.000000', NULL, 1);
