(4299963, 619825, 65035, '<td valign="top">Ahhhh I love portraits that say something about the person, this is really lovely...well Kudzu is lovely and the sunset, lighting, the overall image....you''re a guy so I guess lovely is a word you''d rather I not use about you...erm you''re cute...in a guy way...I hate commenting on sp''s. It''s just a really good photo OK.</td>', 'Ahhhh I love portraits that say something about the person, this is really lovely...well Kudzu is lovely and the sunset, lighting, the overall image....you''re a guy so I guess lovely is a word you''d rather I not use about you...erm you''re cute...in a guy way...I hate commenting on sp''s. It''s just a really good photo OK.', '2007-12-07 19:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299967, 619715, 65035, '<td valign="top">This is cool, I love the old books and you look a little annoyed at being disturbed, I would be too.</td>', 'This is cool, I love the old books and you look a little annoyed at being disturbed, I would be too.', '2007-12-07 19:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
