(4300012, 619960, 77425, '<td valign="top">I love it. And i may try to copy it with two lights (for two wings) for the "heaven" challenge.</td>', 'I love it. And i may try to copy it with two lights (for two wings) for the "heaven" challenge.', '2007-12-07 19:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
