(4300019, 619450, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is very nicely done, but the head-piercing twig bugs the heck out of me... I also wish you''d off-centered the figure just a tad more, it''s uncomfortably close to being dead-center. Beautiful processing though.</td>', 'This is very nicely done, but the head-piercing twig bugs the heck out of me... I also wish you''d off-centered the figure just a tad more, it''s uncomfortably close to being dead-center. Beautiful processing though.', '2007-12-07 19:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
