(4300515, 619921, 58785, '<td valign="top">I think this shot over a metal surface? or just digitally post processed too much? But... I love it. Nice idea, nice lighting (with flash), unique photo.</td>', 'I think this shot over a metal surface? or just digitally post processed too much? But... I love it. Nice idea, nice lighting (with flash), unique photo.', '2007-12-07 23:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4300522, 619617, 58785, '<td valign="top">You are one of my favorite "crazy" girls in DPC. I am glad you became a member (I think recently). Can''t wait to see your new photos. For this, I love the posing, composition, coloring, everything. Good job ;) one thing though, I would love to see the entire hat :)</td>', 'You are one of my favorite "crazy" girls in DPC. I am glad you became a member (I think recently). Can''t wait to see your new photos. For this, I love the posing, composition, coloring, everything. Good job ;) one thing though, I would love to see the entire hat :)', '2007-12-07 23:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4300526, 619538, 58785, '<td valign="top">Interesting, funny, nice portrait. Love the eyes :) Technically very good, DOF is right on. Overall good photo :)</td>', 'Interesting, funny, nice portrait. Love the eyes :) Technically very good, DOF is right on. Overall good photo :)', '2007-12-07 23:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
