(4300535, 619918, 58785, '<td valign="top">Another simple, nice soft portrait. Sometimes you only ask those. I love it. Technically very nice as well. Lighting very nice. Good job :)</td>', 'Another simple, nice soft portrait. Sometimes you only ask those. I love it. Technically very nice as well. Lighting very nice. Good job :)', '2007-12-07 23:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
