(4300599, 619379, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and 3/4 profile.  Interesting crop. You have incredible eyes.</td>', 'I like the lighting and 3/4 profile.  Interesting crop. You have incredible eyes.', '2007-12-08 00:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4300602, 619244, 15711, '<td valign="top">Front and back- NICE. Honest and unadorned. Love the red shirt. 7</td>', 'Front and back- NICE. Honest and unadorned. Love the red shirt. 7', '2007-12-08 00:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4300603, 619622, 58785, '<td valign="top">AAAH...The Flower. Let''s see if I can comment to this photo which I don''t know who that is ;)<br/> <br/>An angelic photo. Lighting is very good, composition is nice. Soft yet sharp(!) My only dispute in this photo, you gave your flower as much as attention to your own face. I would like to see your face taking over the picture, although you probably planned this way since it''s called the flower :) Good job ju... I mean "you" ;)</td>', 'AAAH...The Flower. Let''s see if I can comment to this photo which I don''t know who that is ;) An angelic photo. Lighting is very good, composition is nice. Soft yet sharp(!) My only dispute in this photo, you gave your flower as much as attention to your own face. I would like to see your face taking over the picture, although you probably planned this way since it''s called the flower :) Good job ju... I mean "you" ;)', '2007-12-08 00:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4300605, 618715, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really lovely.  I like the narrow DOF.  I might remove at least one of the rings, as they distract a smidge from your wonderful face, but no big deal.</td>', 'Really lovely.  I like the narrow DOF.  I might remove at least one of the rings, as they distract a smidge from your wonderful face, but no big deal.', '2007-12-08 00:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
