(4301246, 618741, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is a peculiar crop. I am not sure I care for the cutting off of the left eye, and I definitely don''t like how the iris is tangent to the image edge. I am bothered by the truncation of the chin, the way the curve of the jaw takes us nowhere. Then the ear is also whacked. Overall, it''s like an "edgy" crop, but then the image itself is so smooth and soft, so those aren''t working in concert for me.<br/> <br/>Still, for all of that, it''s an appealing image, and the focal eye is quite compelling.</td>', 'This is a peculiar crop. I am not sure I care for the cutting off of the left eye, and I definitely don''t like how the iris is tangent to the image edge. I am bothered by the truncation of the chin, the way the curve of the jaw takes us nowhere. Then the ear is also whacked. Overall, it''s like an "edgy" crop, but then the image itself is so smooth and soft, so those aren''t working in concert for me. Still, for all of that, it''s an appealing image, and the focal eye is quite compelling.', '2007-12-08 09:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
