(4301922, 619774, 58785, '<td valign="top">I copied this image, and turned into b&amp;w, it looked better because of the grains. Unique idea, I am not sure about the second person in the picture, but I think it gives a "ordinary day" feeling. Good photo overall :)</td>', 'I copied this image, and turned into b&w, it looked better because of the grains. Unique idea, I am not sure about the second person in the picture, but I think it gives a "ordinary day" feeling. Good photo overall :)', '2007-12-08 17:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4301927, 618202, 58785, '<td valign="top">Out of focus, and I know I am not the only telling you this. Maybe you wanted to give a "soft" feeling, could be done with post process. I like the composition. I am sure you''ll do better next time ;)</td>', 'Out of focus, and I know I am not the only telling you this. Maybe you wanted to give a "soft" feeling, could be done with post process. I like the composition. I am sure you''ll do better next time ;)', '2007-12-08 17:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
