(4301931, 619689, 58785, '<td valign="top">Nice, simple. I like the style :) Ok, things that bothered me: your background, and softness on your eyes. Background could be something better, or something far, and your eyes could be more focused and sharp. Overall is a good photo though :) I like the dark shadow framing :)</td>', 'Nice, simple. I like the style :) Ok, things that bothered me: your background, and softness on your eyes. Background could be something better, or something far, and your eyes could be more focused and sharp. Overall is a good photo though :) I like the dark shadow framing :)', '2007-12-08 17:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4301934, 619670, 58785, '<td valign="top">I know the look (! you''ll find out later why) nice simple composition, good lighting, your eyes could be little more focused or sharper, and a bit more light in your eyes... not too much, just a bit more would do better. Good photo :)</td>', 'I know the look (! you''ll find out later why) nice simple composition, good lighting, your eyes could be little more focused or sharper, and a bit more light in your eyes... not too much, just a bit more would do better. Good photo :)', '2007-12-08 17:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
