(4301968, 619379, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Ah youth.  Not a single line.  Good portrait - the varying focal points actually add to this, in my opinion.</td>', '7 - Ah youth.  Not a single line.  Good portrait - the varying focal points actually add to this, in my opinion.', '2007-12-08 17:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4301969, 617887, 58785, '<td valign="top">It''s a very nice photo. I like the duo color selection, but I don''t know about the out of focus on the left face. I would do either have everything sharp, or have left face much more blur. Overall, good photo :)</td>', 'It''s a very nice photo. I like the duo color selection, but I don''t know about the out of focus on the left face. I would do either have everything sharp, or have left face much more blur. Overall, good photo :)', '2007-12-08 17:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4301970, 617960, 58785, '<td valign="top">Well, some of the portraits don''t need anything but a little smile and good score. A very good photo technically, I love the way you did with hat and all that. Lights are on perfect spot... Good job :)</td>', 'Well, some of the portraits don''t need anything but a little smile and good score. A very good photo technically, I love the way you did with hat and all that. Lights are on perfect spot... Good job :)', '2007-12-08 17:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4301972, 619445, 39850, '<td valign="top">Obviously a personal thing, but in my opinion this image would be much stronger with the simplicity of ''natural''.  You chose this look for a reason, but to me, as a viewer, the dirt seems a bit ''senseless'', especially in what looks like a clean studio environment.</td>', 'Obviously a personal thing, but in my opinion this image would be much stronger with the simplicity of ''natural''.  You chose this look for a reason, but to me, as a viewer, the dirt seems a bit ''senseless'', especially in what looks like a clean studio environment.', '2007-12-08 17:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4301973, 618341, 58785, '<td valign="top">Magazine worthy shot. Colors excellent, matches to your hair; it''s difficult not to vote high... such a beautiful face with very good settings. Good job :)</td>', 'Magazine worthy shot. Colors excellent, matches to your hair; it''s difficult not to vote high... such a beautiful face with very good settings. Good job :)', '2007-12-08 17:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
