(4301977, 619551, 58785, '<td valign="top">Idea is good, I like the photo, but couple things bother me. Your forehead, right where the hat is, too bright. Also, your hand looks like holding your head like "to be or not to be" I kind of understand your goal here, but execution a bit poor if you ask me :/ I am sure you''ll do better next time :)</td>', 'Idea is good, I like the photo, but couple things bother me. Your forehead, right where the hat is, too bright. Also, your hand looks like holding your head like "to be or not to be" I kind of understand your goal here, but execution a bit poor if you ask me :/ I am sure you''ll do better next time :)', '2007-12-08 17:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4301978, 618243, 35321, '<td valign="top">Very well-done!  Would like to see more interaction between the Enzos.</td>', 'Very well-done!  Would like to see more interaction between the Enzos.', '2007-12-08 17:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4301982, 618342, 58785, '<td valign="top">If you didn''t show your ear and your hair, I would give low score honestly. I think it''s a unique photo, I like the colors, and post process. Good picture overall ;)</td>', 'If you didn''t show your ear and your hair, I would give low score honestly. I think it''s a unique photo, I like the colors, and post process. Good picture overall ;)', '2007-12-08 17:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4301985, 618896, 58785, '<td valign="top">I know the look (!) and you will know why after the challenge is over ;)<br/>Technically very good. Post process is also very good. I like the duo colors and composition. Good job :)</td>', 'I know the look (!) and you will know why after the challenge is over ;)Technically very good. Post process is also very good. I like the duo colors and composition. Good job :)', '2007-12-08 17:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
