(4302678, 617701, 48471, '<td valign="top">Very college-ish, although, since shoes are already on my face, don''t get me wrong, I don''t mind it, but, since something is already so strongly there, why not having some other photos on the wall as well? Its emptiness bothers me. I like the expression on the face, I like it a lot.</td>', 'Very college-ish, although, since shoes are already on my face, don''t get me wrong, I don''t mind it, but, since something is already so strongly there, why not having some other photos on the wall as well? Its emptiness bothers me. I like the expression on the face, I like it a lot.', '2007-12-09 02:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4302681, 619830, 48471, '<td valign="top">Good, a textbook example, I''d say. I wish I didn''t read the title, because now I''m trying to see the dark side, which can''t be seen, I think.</td>', 'Good, a textbook example, I''d say. I wish I didn''t read the title, because now I''m trying to see the dark side, which can''t be seen, I think.', '2007-12-09 02:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4302685, 619561, 48471, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, nice idea, but I see a portrait with a face wanting. It really hurts to strugle to find the face. I don''t mind not having a face in portraits at all, but everything in this photo is leading me there, but there I can''t find it. Anyhow, a good playful and lovely take.</td>', 'Hmmm, nice idea, but I see a portrait with a face wanting. It really hurts to strugle to find the face. I don''t mind not having a face in portraits at all, but everything in this photo is leading me there, but there I can''t find it. Anyhow, a good playful and lovely take.', '2007-12-09 03:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4302686, 619922, 48471, '<td valign="top">HO! GOOD! Very nice, you woke me up as well. Well done. Just goes to show how powerfull eyes are.</td>', 'HO! GOOD! Very nice, you woke me up as well. Well done. Just goes to show how powerfull eyes are.', '2007-12-09 03:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4302688, 619785, 48471, '<td valign="top">Nice photo to look at. Nice face as well. But, the pose, slightly open mouth and juicy lips and the idea of a naked body make this an inviting image, a quite erotic one. Well done.</td>', 'Nice photo to look at. Nice face as well. But, the pose, slightly open mouth and juicy lips and the idea of a naked body make this an inviting image, a quite erotic one. Well done.', '2007-12-09 03:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4302692, 619411, 48471, '<td valign="top">A few days ago I saw a French film, Banlieue 13 is the name, and this image just reminded me of the movie. The guy in the movie there is full of tattoos and fights to protect his neighbourhood by jumping from building to building (I couldn''t see whether he had a spider''s toatto). Anyhow, if he had a camera, he''d look just like you. I enjoyed the film, and I''m enjoying your photo. I hope I can remember this longer than the film, though.</td>', 'A few days ago I saw a French film, Banlieue 13 is the name, and this image just reminded me of the movie. The guy in the movie there is full of tattoos and fights to protect his neighbourhood by jumping from building to building (I couldn''t see whether he had a spider''s toatto). Anyhow, if he had a camera, he''d look just like you. I enjoyed the film, and I''m enjoying your photo. I hope I can remember this longer than the film, though.', '2007-12-09 03:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4302695, 619698, 48471, '<td valign="top">Smart. And it looks so.</td>', 'Smart. And it looks so.', '2007-12-09 03:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4302697, 619356, 48471, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about the camera, but the portrait I love. If only you lowered your cheek a bit.</td>', 'I''m not sure about the camera, but the portrait I love. If only you lowered your cheek a bit.', '2007-12-09 03:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4302698, 619720, 48471, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... Funny, you''ve got all the right tones on the face, but the jacket is overblown. A better control of light might help a lot.</td>', 'Hmmm... Funny, you''ve got all the right tones on the face, but the jacket is overblown. A better control of light might help a lot.', '2007-12-09 03:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4302700, 619633, 48471, '<td valign="top">Bravo!</td>', 'Bravo!', '2007-12-09 03:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
