(4302703, 619897, 67363, '<td valign="top">natural beauty..lovely shot</td>', 'natural beauty..lovely shot', '2007-12-09 03:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4302704, 619204, 48471, '<td valign="top">O, that face, that expression is wonderful - the rest is so ... needless!</td>', 'O, that face, that expression is wonderful - the rest is so ... needless!', '2007-12-09 03:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4302707, 618664, 48471, '<td valign="top">If I saw the face of Jose Saramago I''d think Viva Portugal!, not that Portugal has anything to do with it, but just for the hell of it. Now, If I think that, I''d also shout, and when I shout I definitely don''t look so calm. <br/>I don''t care about that guy that plays for Manchester Un., but it seems that you''re a good fan.</td>', 'If I saw the face of Jose Saramago I''d think Viva Portugal!, not that Portugal has anything to do with it, but just for the hell of it. Now, If I think that, I''d also shout, and when I shout I definitely don''t look so calm. I don''t care about that guy that plays for Manchester Un., but it seems that you''re a good fan.', '2007-12-09 03:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4302708, 618920, 48471, '<td valign="top">If you''re a shadow and if Universe is made of particles, yes... but, wait, maybe that''s the way it is... but, then, give me a more interesting shape, I bet that your being doesn''t reduce to a shadow of figure taking pictures, I bet you jump sometimes and spread your arms to hug something. And Time makes sure that you''re always travlleing, becuase it never stops, so you''re always on the road, so road is redundant on you title.</td>', 'If you''re a shadow and if Universe is made of particles, yes... but, wait, maybe that''s the way it is... but, then, give me a more interesting shape, I bet that your being doesn''t reduce to a shadow of figure taking pictures, I bet you jump sometimes and spread your arms to hug something. And Time makes sure that you''re always travlleing, becuase it never stops, so you''re always on the road, so road is redundant on you title.', '2007-12-09 03:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4302709, 619948, 48471, '<td valign="top">The way, the direction you are looking seems very unnatural to me, it looks like you aren''t engaged in playing or enjoying the guitar. Otherwaise, good light and good reflection of light from the guitar, its yellow-orange-ish and the black of your shirt are quite pleasing.</td>', 'The way, the direction you are looking seems very unnatural to me, it looks like you aren''t engaged in playing or enjoying the guitar. Otherwaise, good light and good reflection of light from the guitar, its yellow-orange-ish and the black of your shirt are quite pleasing.', '2007-12-09 03:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
