(4303207, 619045, 48471, '<td valign="top">Buddha''s lesson: once you reach the top, you become silhouette...I guess... Well, if Buddha didn''t say that, then I say, because you told me so.</td>', 'Buddha''s lesson: once you reach the top, you become silhouette...I guess... Well, if Buddha didn''t say that, then I say, because you told me so.', '2007-12-09 10:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303209, 617813, 28172, '<td valign="top">I love the concept.  I wish that one of your eyes were exposed though. Otherwise very nice.</td>', 'I love the concept.  I wish that one of your eyes were exposed though. Otherwise very nice.', '2007-12-09 10:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303210, 617877, 48471, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm, funny, I wrote about Buddha in my previous image, and now I get to see the man himself! How cool is that? <br/> <br/>As for this photo, good idea, nice realization.</td>', 'Hmmmm, funny, I wrote about Buddha in my previous image, and now I get to see the man himself! How cool is that?  As for this photo, good idea, nice realization.', '2007-12-09 10:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303211, 619548, 28172, '<td valign="top">Nice shot! I love the low key lighting.</td>', 'Nice shot! I love the low key lighting.', '2007-12-09 10:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303213, 618659, 28172, '<td valign="top">Very nice concept!</td>', 'Very nice concept!', '2007-12-09 10:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303217, 619252, 48471, '<td valign="top">Cool guy, interesting. Nice pose, I''m not sure you''re allowed to cut your feet. It reminds me of some photos from when people went to the West when it was wild.</td>', 'Cool guy, interesting. Nice pose, I''m not sure you''re allowed to cut your feet. It reminds me of some photos from when people went to the West when it was wild.', '2007-12-09 10:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303218, 618288, 48471, '<td valign="top">Nice light.</td>', 'Nice light.', '2007-12-09 10:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303219, 617807, 48471, '<td valign="top">O, very good, very clever, Id like to see your parody of Memento.</td>', 'O, very good, very clever, Id like to see your parody of Memento.', '2007-12-09 10:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303221, 619365, 48471, '<td valign="top">HA, this is the headbreaker for dnmc nazis or whatever they''re called.<br/> <br/>Good light, nice bucolic image, lovely smile.</td>', 'HA, this is the headbreaker for dnmc nazis or whatever they''re called. Good light, nice bucolic image, lovely smile.', '2007-12-09 10:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303230, 618243, 68599, '<td valign="top">Wow amazing! Curious to see how you did it.</td>', 'Wow amazing! Curious to see how you did it.', '2007-12-09 10:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303233, 619702, 68599, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of the green overlay. Looks a bit OOF, not sure if you intended to do that.</td>', 'Interesting use of the green overlay. Looks a bit OOF, not sure if you intended to do that.', '2007-12-09 10:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303234, 618741, 68599, '<td valign="top">Very nice self-portrait. Soft skin, and big blue eyes :) Well done- 9</td>', 'Very nice self-portrait. Soft skin, and big blue eyes :) Well done- 9', '2007-12-09 10:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303235, 619331, 48471, '<td valign="top">Good light, good pose. Hands are quite a troublemaker in portraits, and I feel this proves it. I don''t know why, maybe because they are taking so much space, but then... I find the beard and lips much more emphasised than the eyes, so maybe shot from the top?</td>', 'Good light, good pose. Hands are quite a troublemaker in portraits, and I feel this proves it. I don''t know why, maybe because they are taking so much space, but then... I find the beard and lips much more emphasised than the eyes, so maybe shot from the top?', '2007-12-09 10:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303238, 619411, 68599, '<td valign="top">very nice post-processing.</td>', 'very nice post-processing.', '2007-12-09 10:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303241, 619936, 68599, '<td valign="top">Very comical! Made me laugh pretty damn hard.</td>', 'Very comical! Made me laugh pretty damn hard.', '2007-12-09 10:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303245, 618340, 68599, '<td valign="top">Better if bigger.</td>', 'Better if bigger.', '2007-12-09 10:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303248, 618341, 48471, '<td valign="top">Get rid of the neclasse, and the feel will be contagious. Good light, nice attack look, clever smile (it''s not a smile, but a kind of an inviting and immediately dismissing thing; if you know how to call it, please let me know).</td>', 'Get rid of the neclasse, and the feel will be contagious. Good light, nice attack look, clever smile (it''s not a smile, but a kind of an inviting and immediately dismissing thing; if you know how to call it, please let me know).', '2007-12-09 10:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303256, 619203, 48471, '<td valign="top">Nice face, good try with the light, but the shadow of the nose is too strong. Lovely eyes. Very photogenic.</td>', 'Nice face, good try with the light, but the shadow of the nose is too strong. Lovely eyes. Very photogenic.', '2007-12-09 10:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303262, 619928, 48471, '<td valign="top">Without the special effect, this would have been a very good photo. With it, I don''t know, I don''t like it. But, this is a self portrait, so you are presenting yourself, and special effects might be your thing, but I''m not convinced. Good control of light.</td>', 'Without the special effect, this would have been a very good photo. With it, I don''t know, I don''t like it. But, this is a self portrait, so you are presenting yourself, and special effects might be your thing, but I''m not convinced. Good control of light.', '2007-12-09 11:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303267, 618243, 48471, '<td valign="top">John Malkovich would be proud. I guess... well, who cares? You should be proud, nice realization. I like the smilig you (the one on the left, next to the sleeping you), the most.</td>', 'John Malkovich would be proud. I guess... well, who cares? You should be proud, nice realization. I like the smilig you (the one on the left, next to the sleeping you), the most.', '2007-12-09 11:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303282, 619778, 48471, '<td valign="top">Yes, jolly indeed! I''m not sure about the geisha part. Still, a lovely energetic photo, I can heat the laugh.</td>', 'Yes, jolly indeed! I''m not sure about the geisha part. Still, a lovely energetic photo, I can heat the laugh.', '2007-12-09 11:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303284, 619846, 48471, '<td valign="top">Add some motion panning by moving the camera, or just take a long exposure shot so to add blur, and your idea will be finalized. As it is, its a half baked good idea.</td>', 'Add some motion panning by moving the camera, or just take a long exposure shot so to add blur, and your idea will be finalized. As it is, its a half baked good idea.', '2007-12-09 11:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303289, 618008, 48471, '<td valign="top">Well, it looks like there''s no need for anyone else, just you are a good party.</td>', 'Well, it looks like there''s no need for anyone else, just you are a good party.', '2007-12-09 11:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303294, 619445, 48471, '<td valign="top">A thinker working in the mine? Good, actually very good light, great control of shapness, nice pose, and very photogenic. Dirt doesnt suit you.</td>', 'A thinker working in the mine? Good, actually very good light, great control of shapness, nice pose, and very photogenic. Dirt doesnt suit you.', '2007-12-09 11:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303297, 619774, 48471, '<td valign="top">Ha, lovely, you are the city...nice idea, I wish I could say the same for teh realization. In fact, I quite like the colours of the city and the street, but not from your room.</td>', 'Ha, lovely, you are the city...nice idea, I wish I could say the same for teh realization. In fact, I quite like the colours of the city and the street, but not from your room.', '2007-12-09 11:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303298, 619102, 48471, '<td valign="top">Good colours, good light, nice use of flash (or reflector), nicepose, and you look like a fun guy to hang around with. Well done presentation.</td>', 'Good colours, good light, nice use of flash (or reflector), nicepose, and you look like a fun guy to hang around with. Well done presentation.', '2007-12-09 11:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303299, 619068, 48471, '<td valign="top">I like the smile, the rest is too much.</td>', 'I like the smile, the rest is too much.', '2007-12-09 11:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303304, 618909, 48471, '<td valign="top">Then you need some Lennon type sunglasses, no?</td>', 'Then you need some Lennon type sunglasses, no?', '2007-12-09 11:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303305, 619745, 48471, '<td valign="top">Clever idea.</td>', 'Clever idea.', '2007-12-09 11:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303307, 619791, 48471, '<td valign="top">Love the colours and playfulness of this.</td>', 'Love the colours and playfulness of this.', '2007-12-09 11:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303310, 619890, 48471, '<td valign="top">Nice dramatic light and pose, but the bat-ephant on the t-shirt looks like a joke...</td>', 'Nice dramatic light and pose, but the bat-ephant on the t-shirt looks like a joke...', '2007-12-09 11:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303311, 619920, 48471, '<td valign="top">Well, this looks like it could be you...seriously...</td>', 'Well, this looks like it could be you...seriously...', '2007-12-09 11:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303315, 619951, 48471, '<td valign="top">Peaceful, comfortable.</td>', 'Peaceful, comfortable.', '2007-12-09 11:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303322, 618162, 48471, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this, no fancy postprocessing, neither mind blowing ideas or visions or whatever, just a simple ordinary nice portrait. But, maybe because the crop is so tight, it''s captivating, but I''m not sure it''s doing it in as a pleasant way as this photo deserves.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this, no fancy postprocessing, neither mind blowing ideas or visions or whatever, just a simple ordinary nice portrait. But, maybe because the crop is so tight, it''s captivating, but I''m not sure it''s doing it in as a pleasant way as this photo deserves.', '2007-12-09 11:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303324, 619936, 48471, '<td valign="top">Nice light.</td>', 'Nice light.', '2007-12-09 11:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303325, 619906, 48471, '<td valign="top">Good light and colours.</td>', 'Good light and colours.', '2007-12-09 11:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303328, 619918, 48471, '<td valign="top">Nice, peaceful, comfortable image. I like the softness.</td>', 'Nice, peaceful, comfortable image. I like the softness.', '2007-12-09 11:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303329, 619234, 48471, '<td valign="top">Good eyes, I bet they''d look good in colour as well.</td>', 'Good eyes, I bet they''d look good in colour as well.', '2007-12-09 11:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303332, 619801, 48471, '<td valign="top">It''s as if Alice, curious about the rabbit, almost entered the hole. It''s quite an erotic image, but not almost a kiss. I love the white in it.</td>', 'It''s as if Alice, curious about the rabbit, almost entered the hole. It''s quite an erotic image, but not almost a kiss. I love the white in it.', '2007-12-09 11:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303333, 619908, 48471, '<td valign="top">Well, not only that, I feel I''m being examined while looking at this photo.</td>', 'Well, not only that, I feel I''m being examined while looking at this photo.', '2007-12-09 11:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303336, 619777, 48471, '<td valign="top">The beer, a must have companion when we watch ourselves and otherselves on tv; the beer tells more.</td>', 'The beer, a must have companion when we watch ourselves and otherselves on tv; the beer tells more.', '2007-12-09 11:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303338, 619716, 48471, '<td valign="top">Fantasy lady with fantastic eyes.</td>', 'Fantasy lady with fantastic eyes.', '2007-12-09 11:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303340, 619933, 48471, '<td valign="top">So good control of light, very well done.</td>', 'So good control of light, very well done.', '2007-12-09 11:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303343, 619925, 48471, '<td valign="top">A good presentation, nice light and pose...</td>', 'A good presentation, nice light and pose...', '2007-12-09 11:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303354, 619495, 48471, '<td valign="top">A presentation of oneself in one of the most private places, well, it''s quite a daring attempt, but I''m not sure it was done well here. Not mundane enough to recognise myself, not exciting enough to want to be you. Just a cold you.</td>', 'A presentation of oneself in one of the most private places, well, it''s quite a daring attempt, but I''m not sure it was done well here. Not mundane enough to recognise myself, not exciting enough to want to be you. Just a cold you.', '2007-12-09 11:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303357, 619789, 48471, '<td valign="top">Artsy, because there many cigarettes to much.</td>', 'Artsy, because there many cigarettes to much.', '2007-12-09 11:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303360, 619855, 48471, '<td valign="top">Desaturation doesn''t help, in fact it has ruined our green eyes, that I''m sure are beautiful.</td>', 'Desaturation doesn''t help, in fact it has ruined our green eyes, that I''m sure are beautiful.', '2007-12-09 11:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303365, 618659, 48471, '<td valign="top">Why amateur, because of the focus? Because, otherwise, the look, the result, the tools, look quite professional. Postprocessing as well.</td>', 'Why amateur, because of the focus? Because, otherwise, the look, the result, the tools, look quite professional. Postprocessing as well.', '2007-12-09 12:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303370, 619536, 48471, '<td valign="top">Good, a honest presentation, and a full one at that, of one''s portrait.</td>', 'Good, a honest presentation, and a full one at that, of one''s portrait.', '2007-12-09 12:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303376, 618742, 48471, '<td valign="top">It looks like it''s in the middle of the title, at the my part, and, by the look, I know it''ll never reach the God part, because you just found out there''s no God! Good light and monochrome conversion.</td>', 'It looks like it''s in the middle of the title, at the my part, and, by the look, I know it''ll never reach the God part, because you just found out there''s no God! Good light and monochrome conversion.', '2007-12-09 12:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303382, 618028, 41914, '<td valign="top">WOW finally a real piece of art. wonderful image I hope this ribbons. Very original. I am not a fan of photoshoped images I consider myself a purest I miss my chemical darkroom. This is photoshop done right. Thank you. 10<br/> <br/>Edit to correct spellling</td>', 'WOW finally a real piece of art. wonderful image I hope this ribbons. Very original. I am not a fan of photoshoped images I consider myself a purest I miss my chemical darkroom. This is photoshop done right. Thank you. 10 Edit to correct spellling', '2007-12-09 12:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303479, 619068, 81184, '<td valign="top">although not unique, this is very well executed! Nice work</td>', 'although not unique, this is very well executed! Nice work', '2007-12-09 13:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303483, 617838, 81184, '<td valign="top">A nice contemplative look, although the lighting seems a little defused, I would be tempted to over expose a little here, to emphasize the shhh''ness of the pose</td>', 'A nice contemplative look, although the lighting seems a little defused, I would be tempted to over expose a little here, to emphasize the shhh''ness of the pose', '2007-12-09 13:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303566, 617950, 58785, '<td valign="top">A very good portrait. Clean, sharp. Technically good. Backlights nice. Overall a good photo :)</td>', 'A very good portrait. Clean, sharp. Technically good. Backlights nice. Overall a good photo :)', '2007-12-09 13:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303573, 619960, 58785, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting, posing focusing... but the background... I wonder if you had a brick background... actually, either flat white background or some of the paint on this wall fall off and you can see the bricks behind it? It''s a good photo overall :)</td>', 'I like the lighting, posing focusing... but the background... I wonder if you had a brick background... actually, either flat white background or some of the paint on this wall fall off and you can see the bricks behind it? It''s a good photo overall :)', '2007-12-09 13:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303575, 619633, 58785, '<td valign="top">Very nice. One thing bothered me in this photo is your position on the frame. For my taste only, if you would stand either in the middle or on the right side instead of left... I would love it more. As is very nice anyway :)</td>', 'Very nice. One thing bothered me in this photo is your position on the frame. For my taste only, if you would stand either in the middle or on the right side instead of left... I would love it more. As is very nice anyway :)', '2007-12-09 13:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303579, 619478, 58785, '<td valign="top">If you would keep your eyes open, and had a better focusing on your eyes, or face in this case, I would vote much higher. Interesting unique photo. I like the way I can see the snow and all that, I even like the lighting.</td>', 'If you would keep your eyes open, and had a better focusing on your eyes, or face in this case, I would vote much higher. Interesting unique photo. I like the way I can see the snow and all that, I even like the lighting.', '2007-12-09 13:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303580, 619959, 58785, '<td valign="top">Excellent. A magazine shot. Very nice. Technically, post process, composition... A+ very nice portrait photo :)</td>', 'Excellent. A magazine shot. Very nice. Technically, post process, composition... A+ very nice portrait photo :)', '2007-12-09 13:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303581, 617838, 58785, '<td valign="top">Attractive. Technically good, I like the lighting and focusing. Good photo overall :)</td>', 'Attractive. Technically good, I like the lighting and focusing. Good photo overall :)', '2007-12-09 13:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303583, 619812, 58785, '<td valign="top">Unique photo. I like the way you lit up your face over everything else. Composition is nice... Overall a good photo :)</td>', 'Unique photo. I like the way you lit up your face over everything else. Composition is nice... Overall a good photo :)', '2007-12-09 13:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303588, 618201, 58785, '<td valign="top">Here is what I can say about this photo. If you didn''t try two person thing, and kept the one on the left, regular shot, this photo might be doing better. You already had a good lighting and good composition. The location you are in, left, and right side is dark is very nice. It''s a good photo overall though. Nothing wrong trying something creative :)</td>', 'Here is what I can say about this photo. If you didn''t try two person thing, and kept the one on the left, regular shot, this photo might be doing better. You already had a good lighting and good composition. The location you are in, left, and right side is dark is very nice. It''s a good photo overall though. Nothing wrong trying something creative :)', '2007-12-09 14:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303590, 619849, 86952, '<td valign="top">love the title!!</td>', 'love the title!!', '2007-12-09 14:02:05.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4303596, 619862, 86952, '<td valign="top">good concept. But as a portrait, I barely see you as the subject</td>', 'good concept. But as a portrait, I barely see you as the subject', '2007-12-09 14:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303600, 618540, 58785, '<td valign="top">Cute :) Nice lighting on the face. As a matter of fact, lighting is too good, gave shadows of the chair :) Flash? I have this feeling that you are not too comfortable in this posing. I say it''s a good photo overall :)</td>', 'Cute :) Nice lighting on the face. As a matter of fact, lighting is too good, gave shadows of the chair :) Flash? I have this feeling that you are not too comfortable in this posing. I say it''s a good photo overall :)', '2007-12-09 14:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303601, 619713, 87560, '<td valign="top">The crazy beard makes this for me, both echoing and reinforcing the play in the background, both of the landscape and the few stray hairs. I assume this was shot on a windy day--hair doesn''t grow that way naturally! <br/> <br/>Very Hemingwayesque, despite the Mishima title. I''m not sure the title really fits.</td>', 'The crazy beard makes this for me, both echoing and reinforcing the play in the background, both of the landscape and the few stray hairs. I assume this was shot on a windy day--hair doesn''t grow that way naturally!  Very Hemingwayesque, despite the Mishima title. I''m not sure the title really fits.', '2007-12-09 14:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303604, 619698, 58785, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Simple. Technically has some glitches. Little overexposed on hands, but you had to show your face, so I think it''s normal. If you would frame your face, instead of aiming for your eye... Anyway, good photo overall :)</td>', 'Interesting. Simple. Technically has some glitches. Little overexposed on hands, but you had to show your face, so I think it''s normal. If you would frame your face, instead of aiming for your eye... Anyway, good photo overall :)', '2007-12-09 14:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303610, 619741, 58785, '<td valign="top">I hate apple... 1<br/> <br/>No kidding. Although I don''t use, never used and never will use apple, let&amp;#8217;s talk about this photo. It is an apple commercial more than yourself. But I still like it. It''s an interesting and unique idea :) Good one overall :)</td>', 'I hate apple... 1 No kidding. Although I don''t use, never used and never will use apple, let&#8217;s talk about this photo. It is an apple commercial more than yourself. But I still like it. It''s an interesting and unique idea :) Good one overall :)', '2007-12-09 14:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303611, 619704, 58785, '<td valign="top">Technically very nice photo. Clear, I like bw... I usually don''t give a point or two if I don''t see any part of the face, but this one pretty good technically, I will skip my tradition :) Nice photo :)</td>', 'Technically very nice photo. Clear, I like bw... I usually don''t give a point or two if I don''t see any part of the face, but this one pretty good technically, I will skip my tradition :) Nice photo :)', '2007-12-09 14:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303612, 619748, 58785, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, technically good photo. Sharp. Lighting is good. I am not sure about the shadows on the wall though. Maybe you did it for some reason. This is a nice photo overall :)</td>', 'Interesting idea, technically good photo. Sharp. Lighting is good. I am not sure about the shadows on the wall though. Maybe you did it for some reason. This is a nice photo overall :)', '2007-12-09 14:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303613, 619862, 87560, '<td valign="top">This caught my eye because it is quirky in a garishly interesting way. The title does too much explaining for my taste, but I love the smeary bleary colored lights. Thank you for challenging the challenge with something that isn''t so straightforward.</td>', 'This caught my eye because it is quirky in a garishly interesting way. The title does too much explaining for my taste, but I love the smeary bleary colored lights. Thank you for challenging the challenge with something that isn''t so straightforward.', '2007-12-09 14:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303614, 619936, 30791, '<td valign="top">hahaha very creative.</td>', 'hahaha very creative.', '2007-12-09 14:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303617, 618990, 87560, '<td valign="top">I think you''re relying a little too much on the Plath quote to do the work of the portrait for you. Take it away, and there is nothing here that really says "Bell Jar" to me.</td>', 'I think you''re relying a little too much on the Plath quote to do the work of the portrait for you. Take it away, and there is nothing here that really says "Bell Jar" to me.', '2007-12-09 14:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303622, 617950, 87560, '<td valign="top">This isn''t one thing or the other--it isn''t "finished" enough to be a glossy self-portrait or grungy/off-hand enough to feel like a snapshot. Nor is there anything particularly striking in the expression to be memorable. Sorry.</td>', 'This isn''t one thing or the other--it isn''t "finished" enough to be a glossy self-portrait or grungy/off-hand enough to feel like a snapshot. Nor is there anything particularly striking in the expression to be memorable. Sorry.', '2007-12-09 14:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303625, 618696, 58785, '<td valign="top">Unique, interesting photo. Technically not much going on, but I will vote for the idea most likely. I think it''s a nice composition though. Red idea is ok here, gives me the feeling of "Heat".</td>', 'Unique, interesting photo. Technically not much going on, but I will vote for the idea most likely. I think it''s a nice composition though. Red idea is ok here, gives me the feeling of "Heat".', '2007-12-09 14:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303629, 619059, 58785, '<td valign="top">Interesting. If you had your face little brighter and sharper, nit much, just a bit more, I would like this photo more.</td>', 'Interesting. If you had your face little brighter and sharper, nit much, just a bit more, I would like this photo more.', '2007-12-09 14:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303630, 619745, 87560, '<td valign="top">I voted another Christmas ornament portrait higher--who knew this is almost a subgenre of portraiture? Perhaps if the tip of the light weren''t there the picture might read as more "pure" to my eye, but this is almost TOO straightforward for my taste. But thank you for trying something to challenge the challenge.</td>', 'I voted another Christmas ornament portrait higher--who knew this is almost a subgenre of portraiture? Perhaps if the tip of the light weren''t there the picture might read as more "pure" to my eye, but this is almost TOO straightforward for my taste. But thank you for trying something to challenge the challenge.', '2007-12-09 14:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303633, 618945, 58785, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like the lights, the color, idea... Nice unique photo. All I can say is "Good job" ;)</td>', 'Very nice. I like the lights, the color, idea... Nice unique photo. All I can say is "Good job" ;)', '2007-12-09 14:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303634, 617741, 87560, '<td valign="top">The half-shadow works for me--that eye really pops. Nice lighting on this.</td>', 'The half-shadow works for me--that eye really pops. Nice lighting on this.', '2007-12-09 14:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303635, 619824, 58785, '<td valign="top">I like the B&amp;W... sharp photo. One little thing here bothered me. I wish you''d open up your eyes, drop the turban (I think that''s what''s called) a bit more down to your nose. Now your eyes look like hiding too much and they are very beautiful. Good photo overall :)</td>', 'I like the B&W... sharp photo. One little thing here bothered me. I wish you''d open up your eyes, drop the turban (I think that''s what''s called) a bit more down to your nose. Now your eyes look like hiding too much and they are very beautiful. Good photo overall :)', '2007-12-09 14:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303640, 619495, 58785, '<td valign="top">Is that the photo string you are pulling? I would really love this photo if you didn''t pull that string and act like brushing your teeth. You probably had something else in your mind here, but I don''t see anything else. Technically good photo, idea is very nice. I would say is a good portrait overall :)</td>', 'Is that the photo string you are pulling? I would really love this photo if you didn''t pull that string and act like brushing your teeth. You probably had something else in your mind here, but I don''t see anything else. Technically good photo, idea is very nice. I would say is a good portrait overall :)', '2007-12-09 14:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303643, 617877, 58785, '<td valign="top">Think about this, you had your face lid as the Buddha&amp;#8217;s face instead of being all covered with shadow. I can visualize it, and probably would give you higher vote. It''s not a bad idea, but I think execution need a bit more work. Of course it''s me talking. If you like, then it''s a good photo.</td>', 'Think about this, you had your face lid as the Buddha&#8217;s face instead of being all covered with shadow. I can visualize it, and probably would give you higher vote. It''s not a bad idea, but I think execution need a bit more work. Of course it''s me talking. If you like, then it''s a good photo.', '2007-12-09 14:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303644, 618921, 58785, '<td valign="top">Things are good here. Idea, composition, focus... but lighting a bit too bright in some areas, like your hand and your face. It''s a good photo overall :)</td>', 'Things are good here. Idea, composition, focus... but lighting a bit too bright in some areas, like your hand and your face. It''s a good photo overall :)', '2007-12-09 14:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303647, 617999, 58785, '<td valign="top">A very good photo. Technically good, idea is good, execution is good. Overall is a very nice photo :)</td>', 'A very good photo. Technically good, idea is good, execution is good. Overall is a very nice photo :)', '2007-12-09 14:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303656, 619254, 58785, '<td valign="top">This could also be a "Car advertisement" challenge photo :) Consol is very clear, sharp. I can''t see you much, your hands blurry too. I like outside though. I don''t know, this shot has a good potential if taken better. Example: I rather see your eyes from the mirror, instead of your hat. I also would like to see your hands sharp not blurry, since there is nothing else is happening like a deer crossing by.</td>', 'This could also be a "Car advertisement" challenge photo :) Consol is very clear, sharp. I can''t see you much, your hands blurry too. I like outside though. I don''t know, this shot has a good potential if taken better. Example: I rather see your eyes from the mirror, instead of your hat. I also would like to see your hands sharp not blurry, since there is nothing else is happening like a deer crossing by.', '2007-12-09 14:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303659, 619941, 58785, '<td valign="top">Pull the frame a bit up and left... not much, just a bit. And keep the post process a little less, I think this shot be very good. Right now, it''s just "good" :) A nice shot overall :)</td>', 'Pull the frame a bit up and left... not much, just a bit. And keep the post process a little less, I think this shot be very good. Right now, it''s just "good" :) A nice shot overall :)', '2007-12-09 14:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303661, 619462, 87560, '<td valign="top">There really isn''t anything here that particularly reads "Mapplethorpian" to me--I mean, the kitschy leather boots can only "read" so far--and they, and the nudity are the Mapplesque signifiers here. In essence, you''re piggybacking on someone else''s reputation, using it to do most of the work for you.<br/> <br/>The lighting doesn''t really work here for me at all. My eye keeps being pulled to the strange triangulation of shadow on the chest, rather than to the portrait as a whole. Mapplethorpe''s lighting is far more, hmm, I guess the best word would be precise (in fact, I find that the lighting is often the most interesting thing about Mapplethorpe''s portraits). And the pose seems strangely demure for a portrait proclaiming to be "In Mappleseque."</td>', 'There really isn''t anything here that particularly reads "Mapplethorpian" to me--I mean, the kitschy leather boots can only "read" so far--and they, and the nudity are the Mapplesque signifiers here. In essence, you''re piggybacking on someone else''s reputation, using it to do most of the work for you. The lighting doesn''t really work here for me at all. My eye keeps being pulled to the strange triangulation of shadow on the chest, rather than to the portrait as a whole. Mapplethorpe''s lighting is far more, hmm, I guess the best word would be precise (in fact, I find that the lighting is often the most interesting thing about Mapplethorpe''s portraits). And the pose seems strangely demure for a portrait proclaiming to be "In Mappleseque."', '2007-12-09 14:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303664, 619462, 58785, '<td valign="top">You know, this photo technically very good, and I like b&amp;w photos, it''s difficult to give low point. Made me laugh, which is good, you have done good job with shadows and composition. I can say excellent job. Very nice photo overall :)</td>', 'You know, this photo technically very good, and I like b&w photos, it''s difficult to give low point. Made me laugh, which is good, you have done good job with shadows and composition. I can say excellent job. Very nice photo overall :)', '2007-12-09 14:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303665, 618510, 58785, '<td valign="top">Intense, and a perfect photo. Technically perfect. Very good job :)</td>', 'Intense, and a perfect photo. Technically perfect. Very good job :)', '2007-12-09 14:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303667, 619547, 58785, '<td valign="top">Ok, so you have "mood" problems. The time you turn your had the other way, you can go from happy to sad very quick. I see the story, Nice execution. Lighting needs a bit more work, for example, left happy face lid up much more than middle face and right "sad" face. Not a bad photo overall :)</td>', 'Ok, so you have "mood" problems. The time you turn your had the other way, you can go from happy to sad very quick. I see the story, Nice execution. Lighting needs a bit more work, for example, left happy face lid up much more than middle face and right "sad" face. Not a bad photo overall :)', '2007-12-09 14:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303672, 619713, 1024, '<td valign="top">Love the reference to that movie.  Great segway, the photo is fitting.</td>', 'Love the reference to that movie.  Great segway, the photo is fitting.', '2007-12-09 14:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303677, 618896, 87560, '<td valign="top">VERY Dr. Caligui-esque.</td>', 'VERY Dr. Caligui-esque.', '2007-12-09 14:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303686, 619656, 87560, '<td valign="top">I thought this was intriguing--the shaft of light really works for me, and the title is evocative in a good way. But I''m a sucker for Narrative Tease...</td>', 'I thought this was intriguing--the shaft of light really works for me, and the title is evocative in a good way. But I''m a sucker for Narrative Tease...', '2007-12-09 14:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
