(4303691, 617960, 30861, '<td valign="top">The technical gestalt here is "mall Studio", utterly banal, but the hat and the expression are SO outside that. I have come back tot his many times and it always makes me smile, so I am giving you a large bump. My first reaction was "blehhh", but now I love it.</td>', 'The technical gestalt here is "mall Studio", utterly banal, but the hat and the expression are SO outside that. I have come back tot his many times and it always makes me smile, so I am giving you a large bump. My first reaction was "blehhh", but now I love it.', '2007-12-09 15:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4303693, 619440, 87560, '<td valign="top">Hmm, cute idea, but someone I think I would have liked it better if Mrs. Grinch wasn''t smiling. YMMV...</td>', 'Hmm, cute idea, but someone I think I would have liked it better if Mrs. Grinch wasn''t smiling. YMMV...', '2007-12-09 15:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
