(4304166, 617813, 58785, '<td valign="top">Nice, if you would take a bit more time this photo could be much better. Hiding your face, well, at least you could show the eyes. That''s ok.  Seems like you wanted to share the whole frame with your shadow, if so I wish your shadow would be a bit darker. A frame would do fine with this posing also. Overall is a good photo :)</td>', 'Nice, if you would take a bit more time this photo could be much better. Hiding your face, well, at least you could show the eyes. That''s ok.  Seems like you wanted to share the whole frame with your shadow, if so I wish your shadow would be a bit darker. A frame would do fine with this posing also. Overall is a good photo :)', '2007-12-09 19:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304169, 618340, 77838, '<td valign="top">The lines on the photo make your face make it look like your crying.</td>', 'The lines on the photo make your face make it look like your crying.', '2007-12-09 19:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304171, 618782, 58785, '<td valign="top">Simple, nice photo. Outside, so you have the sun for you lighting. Nice duo color, I would give a bit more brightness and bit more contrast, now it seems like cold even looks like a hot day. Overall nice photo :)</td>', 'Simple, nice photo. Outside, so you have the sun for you lighting. Nice duo color, I would give a bit more brightness and bit more contrast, now it seems like cold even looks like a hot day. Overall nice photo :)', '2007-12-09 19:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304172, 619945, 62249, '<td valign="top">The nostril bubbles are just too unappealing.</td>', 'The nostril bubbles are just too unappealing.', '2007-12-09 19:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304176, 619478, 77838, '<td valign="top">Single light source?  Nice shadow and I still don''t recongnize you.</td>', 'Single light source?  Nice shadow and I still don''t recongnize you.', '2007-12-09 19:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304177, 619810, 58785, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, good lighting, good focusing, very clear and I like the duo color choice :) very good photo overall :)</td>', 'Nice idea, good lighting, good focusing, very clear and I like the duo color choice :) very good photo overall :)', '2007-12-09 19:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304178, 619538, 11518, '<td valign="top">Cute, LOL.  Be careful you might remain cross-eyed! ROFL.  One of your surplus ladybugs? ;)<br/> <br/>Bumping up.  Good luck.</td>', 'Cute, LOL.  Be careful you might remain cross-eyed! ROFL.  One of your surplus ladybugs? ;) Bumping up.  Good luck.', '2007-12-09 19:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304181, 619709, 62249, '<td valign="top">Great expression and skillful processing. But how are you gonna explain you got busted for impersonating a reindeer?</td>', 'Great expression and skillful processing. But how are you gonna explain you got busted for impersonating a reindeer?', '2007-12-09 19:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304185, 619709, 11518, '<td valign="top">LOL, that photo is gonna haunt you forever if it gets to be on the front page!  Well done!</td>', 'LOL, that photo is gonna haunt you forever if it gets to be on the front page!  Well done!', '2007-12-09 19:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304187, 619427, 77838, '<td valign="top">Not sure how to comment but I wish the right side of your face was a little lighter.  BB</td>', 'Not sure how to comment but I wish the right side of your face was a little lighter.  BB', '2007-12-09 19:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304191, 619365, 62249, '<td valign="top">It''s great how the critters in the background help tell your story. Very good shot.</td>', 'It''s great how the critters in the background help tell your story. Very good shot.', '2007-12-09 19:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304192, 617834, 62249, '<td valign="top">Great use of shadows &amp; highlights. Works very well in b/w.</td>', 'Great use of shadows & highlights. Works very well in b/w.', '2007-12-09 19:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304194, 619946, 58785, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Lighting is ok, but first two (from left to right) face looks like overexposed. Middle face looks like want to bite the ear of your face on right. If you had your face, without the three head thing, with the same lighting, I would say it would get better voting. My humble opinion of course :)</td>', 'Interesting. Lighting is ok, but first two (from left to right) face looks like overexposed. Middle face looks like want to bite the ear of your face on right. If you had your face, without the three head thing, with the same lighting, I would say it would get better voting. My humble opinion of course :)', '2007-12-09 19:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304195, 618243, 62249, '<td valign="top">Excellent! It''s hard enough to do one good shot, but you''ve done it multiple times and then masterfully pulled them all together. Brilliant.</td>', 'Excellent! It''s hard enough to do one good shot, but you''ve done it multiple times and then masterfully pulled them all together. Brilliant.', '2007-12-09 19:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304196, 618510, 62249, '<td valign="top">Excellent! Love the attitude, texture, and detail.</td>', 'Excellent! Love the attitude, texture, and detail.', '2007-12-09 19:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304197, 619702, 58785, '<td valign="top">Nice. Although it''s not focused, still is a good photo. What makes it good is the background, and the color selection :) nice lighting, good composition :) God job :)</td>', 'Nice. Although it''s not focused, still is a good photo. What makes it good is the background, and the color selection :) nice lighting, good composition :) God job :)', '2007-12-09 19:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304198, 618697, 62249, '<td valign="top">Good drama. Great clouds  with excellent tonal range, and the face is lit just right. Wish you had toned down the white specks (snaps?) on the coat.</td>', 'Good drama. Great clouds  with excellent tonal range, and the face is lit just right. Wish you had toned down the white specks (snaps?) on the coat.', '2007-12-09 19:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304200, 619922, 62249, '<td valign="top">Great expression, well shot, and well processed. Good job!</td>', 'Great expression, well shot, and well processed. Good job!', '2007-12-09 19:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304201, 618990, 58785, '<td valign="top">Yeap. simple, clean. nice close-up portrait. If you had your eyes focused and sharpened, this could be killer. After the challenge, if you want try this, Take a similar photo, and focus on your eye, with tighter dof. Give duo color of your choice, not much though, and show us :) Good picture overall though :)</td>', 'Yeap. simple, clean. nice close-up portrait. If you had your eyes focused and sharpened, this could be killer. After the challenge, if you want try this, Take a similar photo, and focus on your eye, with tighter dof. Give duo color of your choice, not much though, and show us :) Good picture overall though :)', '2007-12-09 19:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304207, 617927, 58785, '<td valign="top">Nice. I tried this photo in grayscale, and it was much better than colored one, and the reason is that your cheek has overexposed a bit, in grayscale it''s not that much noticeable. Overall I like your photo, very nice job :)</td>', 'Nice. I tried this photo in grayscale, and it was much better than colored one, and the reason is that your cheek has overexposed a bit, in grayscale it''s not that much noticeable. Overall I like your photo, very nice job :)', '2007-12-09 19:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304209, 619099, 58785, '<td valign="top">nice. Very creative, and good composition. Excellent execution of an idea. I wish though this photo would be a bit brighter :/ Overall, I like it :)</td>', 'nice. Very creative, and good composition. Excellent execution of an idea. I wish though this photo would be a bit brighter :/ Overall, I like it :)', '2007-12-09 19:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304213, 619517, 58785, '<td valign="top">You had this very nice, in a wrong place. This is my opinion only, you could do the same thing in a street, or basement... some place more dramatic. Also, a little more tight dof, bit more dark edges on the photo would make this photo excellent :) Overall, it''s a good photo :)</td>', 'You had this very nice, in a wrong place. This is my opinion only, you could do the same thing in a street, or basement... some place more dramatic. Also, a little more tight dof, bit more dark edges on the photo would make this photo excellent :) Overall, it''s a good photo :)', '2007-12-09 19:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304214, 618598, 58785, '<td valign="top">nice lighting, nice composition, nice idea. Good job overall :)</td>', 'nice lighting, nice composition, nice idea. Good job overall :)', '2007-12-09 19:21:12.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4304217, 619483, 58785, '<td valign="top">A big ornament there. nice idea. Second time I saw this idea. Both have unique execution of course. The thing is, you seem like an experienced photographer, and you could do this shot much better... sharper, more contrast :/ I like it though :)</td>', 'A big ornament there. nice idea. Second time I saw this idea. Both have unique execution of course. The thing is, you seem like an experienced photographer, and you could do this shot much better... sharper, more contrast :/ I like it though :)', '2007-12-09 19:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304219, 619775, 58785, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Poster like photo. Very nice post process, lighting is very good, and story is good too. Excellent job :)</td>', 'Very nice. Poster like photo. Very nice post process, lighting is very good, and story is good too. Excellent job :)', '2007-12-09 19:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304221, 619954, 77838, '<td valign="top">Your skin does seem to blend right into the wall.  The whole picture overall seems a little noisy.  BB</td>', 'Your skin does seem to blend right into the wall.  The whole picture overall seems a little noisy.  BB', '2007-12-09 19:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304223, 619450, 58785, '<td valign="top">Ah. my friend, I really like this photo but I don''t like the branch. It just kills the good photo makes it a humorous one. I will close my eyes and pretend that branch is not there and vote thus way. Technically perfect, and very nice composition. Good photo overall :)</td>', 'Ah. my friend, I really like this photo but I don''t like the branch. It just kills the good photo makes it a humorous one. I will close my eyes and pretend that branch is not there and vote thus way. Technically perfect, and very nice composition. Good photo overall :)', '2007-12-09 19:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304224, 619068, 58785, '<td valign="top">Clean, nice, welldone. Interesting photo :)</td>', 'Clean, nice, welldone. Interesting photo :)', '2007-12-09 19:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304227, 618664, 58785, '<td valign="top">My ex-wife from there, so I am giving you 1...<br/> <br/>Then again, let&amp;#8217;s talk about the photo, not the country. I think preparation is excellent. The positioning on the frame is very good. Sharp and nice photo with good message. Overall good photo :)</td>', 'My ex-wife from there, so I am giving you 1... Then again, let&#8217;s talk about the photo, not the country. I think preparation is excellent. The positioning on the frame is very good. Sharp and nice photo with good message. Overall good photo :)', '2007-12-09 19:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304230, 619863, 58785, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I would like to congratulate you for your courage. Nicely done sexy photo, everything else looks very good, technically and composition. Very good job overall :)</td>', 'Very nice. I would like to congratulate you for your courage. Nicely done sexy photo, everything else looks very good, technically and composition. Very good job overall :)', '2007-12-09 19:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304232, 619840, 58785, '<td valign="top">Well someone is having a big pain here... and needs to go wash the face ... NOW! and don''t touch anything on your way...<br/> <br/>Interesting. Quick shot to catch the moment :/</td>', 'Well someone is having a big pain here... and needs to go wash the face ... NOW! and don''t touch anything on your way... Interesting. Quick shot to catch the moment :/', '2007-12-09 19:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304233, 619493, 58785, '<td valign="top">nice, a bit dark for me. But eyes are very cool. The lights in there getting all the attention, and maybe that''s why you left the rest dark. Good composition. Nice photo overall :)</td>', 'nice, a bit dark for me. But eyes are very cool. The lights in there getting all the attention, and maybe that''s why you left the rest dark. Good composition. Nice photo overall :)', '2007-12-09 19:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304235, 619903, 58785, '<td valign="top">Idea is good, execution a bit poor, but nothing personal. I don''t even know you so, don''t start yelling "REVENGE". Too dark, the settings are ok, I can see it''s sharp, focused... lighting even not bad, but overall is kind of dark.</td>', 'Idea is good, execution a bit poor, but nothing personal. I don''t even know you so, don''t start yelling "REVENGE". Too dark, the settings are ok, I can see it''s sharp, focused... lighting even not bad, but overall is kind of dark.', '2007-12-09 19:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304236, 619715, 58785, '<td valign="top">nice, sharp. Good colors and lighting. I like the idea. Not bad overall. A frame would do good in this photo.</td>', 'nice, sharp. Good colors and lighting. I like the idea. Not bad overall. A frame would do good in this photo.', '2007-12-09 19:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304240, 619411, 58785, '<td valign="top">A very interesting and creative photo. It is done very well, and processed very well,. If the light on the bottom wasn''t there... I would like it more. Overall, excellent shot :)</td>', 'A very interesting and creative photo. It is done very well, and processed very well,. If the light on the bottom wasn''t there... I would like it more. Overall, excellent shot :)', '2007-12-09 19:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304243, 619561, 58785, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition, very good idea, and execution... If you had your face sharp and clear, with more contrast and rest of the scene like your face here, not too sharp, and maybe dimmed a bit, this photo would be a lot better in my opinion. Good job overall :)</td>', 'Very nice composition, very good idea, and execution... If you had your face sharp and clear, with more contrast and rest of the scene like your face here, not too sharp, and maybe dimmed a bit, this photo would be a lot better in my opinion. Good job overall :)', '2007-12-09 19:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304247, 619955, 58785, '<td valign="top">nice dof. Good lighting. Nice composition. Your nose has all the attention due to sharpness. If you had your eyes focused a bit more, I would like it more :P Good photo overall :)</td>', 'nice dof. Good lighting. Nice composition. Your nose has all the attention due to sharpness. If you had your eyes focused a bit more, I would like it more :P Good photo overall :)', '2007-12-09 19:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304249, 619710, 58785, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Good clear photo, nice stop motion idea. Good lighting. Overall, excellent job :)</td>', 'Nicely done. Good clear photo, nice stop motion idea. Good lighting. Overall, excellent job :)', '2007-12-09 19:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304251, 619895, 58785, '<td valign="top">Very good execution of an idea (or a good copy). Nice lighting, sharp focused eyes. Overall a nice photo :)</td>', 'Very good execution of an idea (or a good copy). Nice lighting, sharp focused eyes. Overall a nice photo :)', '2007-12-09 19:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304252, 617848, 58785, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. Technically could be better with more focusing and tighter dof. But overall is a good photo :)</td>', 'Nice photo. Technically could be better with more focusing and tighter dof. But overall is a good photo :)', '2007-12-09 19:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304254, 619770, 58785, '<td valign="top">Merry Christmas to you too. I am glad you have this photo here. Simple, very nice. Technically excellent. A very good job overall :)</td>', 'Merry Christmas to you too. I am glad you have this photo here. Simple, very nice. Technically excellent. A very good job overall :)', '2007-12-09 19:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304258, 619682, 58785, '<td valign="top">Nice photo that I call "Art". I usually take a point or two if I don''t see at least partial face in portrait challenge (which this is my first voting I think), but this one is very good, technically and pos process very nicely done, I will skip my tradition. Very nice photo overall :)</td>', 'Nice photo that I call "Art". I usually take a point or two if I don''t see at least partial face in portrait challenge (which this is my first voting I think), but this one is very good, technically and pos process very nicely done, I will skip my tradition. Very nice photo overall :)', '2007-12-09 19:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304260, 619291, 58785, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Can''t find anything wrong with this photo. Very clear, colors are awesome, background is a very nice idea. Lighting is perfect. Although nothing interesting going on, quality of your photo gets everything. Nice job :)</td>', 'Excellent. Can''t find anything wrong with this photo. Very clear, colors are awesome, background is a very nice idea. Lighting is perfect. Although nothing interesting going on, quality of your photo gets everything. Nice job :)', '2007-12-09 19:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304262, 619618, 58785, '<td valign="top">Maybe because you had to stand still for a second or two, there is some blur. I tell ya, if your face would be sharp, this might be a very nice photo. Now is a good photo :) nice idea too by the way :)</td>', 'Maybe because you had to stand still for a second or two, there is some blur. I tell ya, if your face would be sharp, this might be a very nice photo. Now is a good photo :) nice idea too by the way :)', '2007-12-09 19:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304266, 618726, 58785, '<td valign="top">Nice. I like the idea, composition. But execution, actually settings I think could be better. Here is what I would like to see: Sharper and focused eyes, shadow frame. Overall though is a very nice photo :)</td>', 'Nice. I like the idea, composition. But execution, actually settings I think could be better. Here is what I would like to see: Sharper and focused eyes, shadow frame. Overall though is a very nice photo :)', '2007-12-09 19:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304271, 618843, 58785, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but your eyes had to be focused here. Little sharp eyes would make this photo better. nice lighting, not too much. Overall is a good photo :)</td>', 'Nice idea but your eyes had to be focused here. Little sharp eyes would make this photo better. nice lighting, not too much. Overall is a good photo :)', '2007-12-09 19:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304272, 619548, 58785, '<td valign="top">You captured a good portrait; you didn''t need the cigarette in my opinion. The hood, and color of the sweatshirt is very nice. Good framing and lighting, but cigarette takes it all away from you. Overall, is a nice photo :)</td>', 'You captured a good portrait; you didn''t need the cigarette in my opinion. The hood, and color of the sweatshirt is very nice. Good framing and lighting, but cigarette takes it all away from you. Overall, is a nice photo :)', '2007-12-09 19:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304273, 619252, 58785, '<td valign="top">Excellent. I love the posing, with your beard, this is one for the magazines :) no joke. Very good technically. Very good job :)</td>', 'Excellent. I love the posing, with your beard, this is one for the magazines :) no joke. Very good technically. Very good job :)', '2007-12-09 19:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304274, 619440, 58785, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Love the idea, and execution. Love the post process. Very good job ;)</td>', 'Very cool. Love the idea, and execution. Love the post process. Very good job ;)', '2007-12-09 19:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304275, 619203, 58785, '<td valign="top">A wonderful portrait. I totally love it. Very clear, sharp. Lighting is excellent. Your beauty  just jumps out. Excellent excellent job :)</td>', 'A wonderful portrait. I totally love it. Very clear, sharp. Lighting is excellent. Your beauty  just jumps out. Excellent excellent job :)', '2007-12-09 19:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304281, 619849, 58785, '<td valign="top">nice. I tell you what. You posed very nicely, I like this photo, clean sharp (could be sharper) but why didn''t you do this with darker background. Oh man, it would be much better. Now it looks like a quick shot in the office, put the same thing with dark background with light, filler and a main... Why don''t you do that after challenge is over, I bet you everyone else would agree with me :) Good photo overall :)</td>', 'nice. I tell you what. You posed very nicely, I like this photo, clean sharp (could be sharper) but why didn''t you do this with darker background. Oh man, it would be much better. Now it looks like a quick shot in the office, put the same thing with dark background with light, filler and a main... Why don''t you do that after challenge is over, I bet you everyone else would agree with me :) Good photo overall :)', '2007-12-09 19:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304285, 619104, 58785, '<td valign="top">There you go. Polar bear club member ready to jump into icy water :) Very cool idea, nice lighting, sharp focused face. Overall, very good job :)</td>', 'There you go. Polar bear club member ready to jump into icy water :) Very cool idea, nice lighting, sharp focused face. Overall, very good job :)', '2007-12-09 20:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304286, 619731, 58785, '<td valign="top">Nice. Although too many things going on, I like the idea. nice preparation and execution. Overall, good job :)</td>', 'Nice. Although too many things going on, I like the idea. nice preparation and execution. Overall, good job :)', '2007-12-09 20:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304287, 619787, 58785, '<td valign="top">A magazine photo. Very nicely done. I like the post process. Lighting and everything else technically perfect. Good job :)</td>', 'A magazine photo. Very nicely done. I like the post process. Lighting and everything else technically perfect. Good job :)', '2007-12-09 20:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304288, 619547, 77838, '<td valign="top">This looks just like a canvas print that you took a picture of.  I wish it could''ve been just a little sharper and not quite so blurry.  Just my opinion.  BB</td>', 'This looks just like a canvas print that you took a picture of.  I wish it could''ve been just a little sharper and not quite so blurry.  Just my opinion.  BB', '2007-12-09 20:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304289, 617951, 77838, '<td valign="top">You should''ve tipped your head up just a bit to where we (the viewer) could see your eyes.  BB</td>', 'You should''ve tipped your head up just a bit to where we (the viewer) could see your eyes.  BB', '2007-12-09 20:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304293, 619636, 58785, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea. I like the composition, and lighting. All you had to do is a bit more focusing on your face, a bit sharper eyes.... Overall is a good photo.</td>', 'I really like the idea. I like the composition, and lighting. All you had to do is a bit more focusing on your face, a bit sharper eyes.... Overall is a good photo.', '2007-12-09 20:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304296, 619159, 77838, '<td valign="top">Your photo is too white for me.  I would''ve liked a little more detail.  You could''ve still left it in the blue/white tones just more detail.  BB</td>', 'Your photo is too white for me.  I would''ve liked a little more detail.  You could''ve still left it in the blue/white tones just more detail.  BB', '2007-12-09 20:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304297, 617835, 58785, '<td valign="top">First I couldn''t see you there, camouflaged to the wall :) I tell you what, I like the background, if  you sit on the left, lighter area, so I could see you first, this photo would do better i think. Overall, good photo :)</td>', 'First I couldn''t see you there, camouflaged to the wall :) I tell you what, I like the background, if  you sit on the left, lighter area, so I could see you first, this photo would do better i think. Overall, good photo :)', '2007-12-09 20:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304299, 619920, 58785, '<td valign="top">nice. Everything is ok here technically but the gun. So, I am sorry I can''t give you 10, but some other vote that you probably wouldn''t mind.</td>', 'nice. Everything is ok here technically but the gun. So, I am sorry I can''t give you 10, but some other vote that you probably wouldn''t mind.', '2007-12-09 20:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304300, 618429, 58785, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like the lighting on your face, the story on your face... the composition. One thing bothers me is the focus on your eyes, but it''s not that important. Good job overall :)</td>', 'Very nice. I like the lighting on your face, the story on your face... the composition. One thing bothers me is the focus on your eyes, but it''s not that important. Good job overall :)', '2007-12-09 20:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304301, 617927, 77838, '<td valign="top">I like your color desaturation here.  Almost a half sepia, half B&amp;W.  BB</td>', 'I like your color desaturation here.  Almost a half sepia, half B&W.  BB', '2007-12-09 20:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304303, 619232, 58785, '<td valign="top">nice. Simple, lighting is good, settings look good. I like the idea :) Very good job :)</td>', 'nice. Simple, lighting is good, settings look good. I like the idea :) Very good job :)', '2007-12-09 20:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304304, 618988, 58785, '<td valign="top">Good photo. Could be a bit more lights there. I like the way you did the lighting left middle and right. Not many people would notice that :) Good picture overall :)</td>', 'Good photo. Could be a bit more lights there. I like the way you did the lighting left middle and right. Not many people would notice that :) Good picture overall :)', '2007-12-09 20:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304306, 619933, 58785, '<td valign="top">nice. Clear, sharp eyes. Good lights. Good composition. Very cool. Good job :)</td>', 'nice. Clear, sharp eyes. Good lights. Good composition. Very cool. Good job :)', '2007-12-09 20:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304308, 619716, 77838, '<td valign="top">Anatolian (Panthera) Leopard - Awesome!  Your mouth looks great in this expression.  I like B&amp;W''s also.</td>', 'Anatolian (Panthera) Leopard - Awesome!  Your mouth looks great in this expression.  I like B&W''s also.', '2007-12-09 20:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304309, 619509, 58785, '<td valign="top">I love Pink Floyd as well. You have a very good photo here. I like the post process. DOF nice. Overall a good job :)</td>', 'I love Pink Floyd as well. You have a very good photo here. I like the post process. DOF nice. Overall a good job :)', '2007-12-09 20:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
