(4305312, 619850, 67257, '<td valign="top">I have a lot of positive things to say about this picture.  I like the surroundings you chose, lighting is good, great use of grey scale, I like the tile in the mirror (it adds some texture to the image), and the mirror frame works well as a frame for the image.  My only critique is that while you are very pretty you seem to be slightly out of focus.</td>', 'I have a lot of positive things to say about this picture.  I like the surroundings you chose, lighting is good, great use of grey scale, I like the tile in the mirror (it adds some texture to the image), and the mirror frame works well as a frame for the image.  My only critique is that while you are very pretty you seem to be slightly out of focus.', '2007-12-10 04:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
