(4305327, 619935, 67257, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective of this picture but since the topic of this challenge is self-portrait I would have like to have seen more of you in it.  The hat over powers this picture and becomes the main topic of the picture.</td>', 'I like the perspective of this picture but since the topic of this challenge is self-portrait I would have like to have seen more of you in it.  The hat over powers this picture and becomes the main topic of the picture.', '2007-12-10 04:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
