(4307786, 617905, 51793, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture. The glare on your eyes from the window really adds that unique feel of being photographed. Being an older woman is a bit harder to photograph but with the right editing age makes for a beautiful image. The yellow is a bit much but that could be my own monitor. I think that you should try playing around with the dodge tool some on the wrinkles to really bring them out, but the tone looks really good on the skin. Meaning it''s not bright (blown out) or not to dark. <br/> <br/>God luck with the challenge. MERRY CHRISTMAS!</td>', 'I really like this picture. The glare on your eyes from the window really adds that unique feel of being photographed. Being an older woman is a bit harder to photograph but with the right editing age makes for a beautiful image. The yellow is a bit much but that could be my own monitor. I think that you should try playing around with the dodge tool some on the wrinkles to really bring them out, but the tone looks really good on the skin. Meaning it''s not bright (blown out) or not to dark.  God luck with the challenge. MERRY CHRISTMAS!', '2007-12-11 07:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
