(4309391, 619715, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  So glad this was you!  After I voted I kinda wondered if it was, but you look very different to me in a lot of your pics, so I wasn''t sure.  The portait does fit you very well.  And the two I had tied for my top spot ended up being two of my fav photogs, and right next to each other in results, too.  Kinda nifty!<br/> <br/>Really like the duo combined with the color.  I''ll have to try that - I often overlay a B&amp;W and fade it back.  It does add a toned downed richness if that makes sense.</td>', 'Excellent!  So glad this was you!  After I voted I kinda wondered if it was, but you look very different to me in a lot of your pics, so I wasn''t sure.  The portait does fit you very well.  And the two I had tied for my top spot ended up being two of my fav photogs, and right next to each other in results, too.  Kinda nifty! Really like the duo combined with the color.  I''ll have to try that - I often overlay a B&W and fade it back.  It does add a toned downed richness if that makes sense.', '2007-12-12 00:12:24.000000', NULL, 0),
