(4309400, 619633, 84907, '<td valign="top">Ok, maybe just me here but this is not even close to where I think this should have placed.  No its not just the skin.  Great lighting, excellent smiling pose, and gives that classy WWII pinup look.  ARG to the votes on this one.  And additionally being relatively new here I didn''t know who this was and now to find out this is the mother of a 15 year old???  Ok people seriously for those of you who knew that and voted less than an 8 shame on you.  This is not the body of someone capable of having a 15 year old, and she has lighting skills to BOOT!<br/> <br/>Great shot sorry the voters don''t agree with me.</td>', 'Ok, maybe just me here but this is not even close to where I think this should have placed.  No its not just the skin.  Great lighting, excellent smiling pose, and gives that classy WWII pinup look.  ARG to the votes on this one.  And additionally being relatively new here I didn''t know who this was and now to find out this is the mother of a 15 year old???  Ok people seriously for those of you who knew that and voted less than an 8 shame on you.  This is not the body of someone capable of having a 15 year old, and she has lighting skills to BOOT! Great shot sorry the voters don''t agree with me.', '2007-12-12 00:14:36.000000', NULL, 0),
