(4309482, 619933, 30982, '<td valign="top">It''s a pain in the butt to get focus on one''s self, ain''t it?  You did a good job with it here (I had the same problem, by the way).  I gave this a 6 in voting.  I liked the pose, I liked the light on your face, and I like the sorta serious, sorta spooky feel to it.  What I didn''t like as well was the way the hoodie disappears completely into the background on the left side of the shot.  A light behind you, maybe on the floor aiming up, to provide just enough separation of you from the background would give this added depth.  Thanks again for commenting on all the shots - it''s a lot of work and it is very much appreciated!</td>', 'It''s a pain in the butt to get focus on one''s self, ain''t it?  You did a good job with it here (I had the same problem, by the way).  I gave this a 6 in voting.  I liked the pose, I liked the light on your face, and I like the sorta serious, sorta spooky feel to it.  What I didn''t like as well was the way the hoodie disappears completely into the background on the left side of the shot.  A light behind you, maybe on the floor aiming up, to provide just enough separation of you from the background would give this added depth.  Thanks again for commenting on all the shots - it''s a lot of work and it is very much appreciated!', '2007-12-12 00:33:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4309483, 617905, 66384, '<td valign="top">Wonderful eyes, Deb, and I love the crop.</td>', 'Wonderful eyes, Deb, and I love the crop.', '2007-12-12 00:33:49.000000', NULL, 0),
