(4309514, 619204, 30982, '<td valign="top">You got your 6!  I thought this was very creative and well done.  Thanks for sharing your notes, too - it''s always interesting to see what lengths we go through to try to get what we want!</td>', 'You got your 6!  I thought this was very creative and well done.  Thanks for sharing your notes, too - it''s always interesting to see what lengths we go through to try to get what we want!', '2007-12-12 00:40:51.000000', NULL, 0),
