(4309529, 619951, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very nice, Dave. I can''t believe you threw this together in an hour. But then I forgot how good you are at portraits. Now I remember those nice portraits you took last summer.</td>', 'Very nice, Dave. I can''t believe you threw this together in an hour. But then I forgot how good you are at portraits. Now I remember those nice portraits you took last summer.', '2007-12-12 00:45:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4309530, 619538, 41357, '<td valign="top">A friend of mine told me that Indian women put the red dot on their forehead to remind them that they left the boiler on.<br/>sweet pic.</td>', 'A friend of mine told me that Indian women put the red dot on their forehead to remind them that they left the boiler on.sweet pic.', '2007-12-12 00:45:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(4309535, 619791, 28742, '<td valign="top">Way to go Sherm!!</td>', 'Way to go Sherm!!', '2007-12-12 00:47:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4309538, 619791, 17851, '<td valign="top">YAY!! congrats!!</td>', 'YAY!! congrats!!', '2007-12-12 00:48:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4309539, 619517, 23002, '<td valign="top">Great shot CJ!  Funny thing is I glanced through some of these during voting.  I looked at this shot, but did not recognize you. LOL<br/> <br/>I think you did a good job of getting the camera a bit higher, so that the flash from the camera causes the shadow to be slightly downword in direction.  I agree with others that the light is a bit harsh for this type of shot.<br/> <br/>The great thing with photoshop is that you can go to a hardware store and buy a haologen work light or two, and play with set ups for lighting and actually shoot with them.  your camera will have a setting for that type of light, or just shoot in black and white...have some fun with it.<br/> <br/>Great job.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Great shot CJ!  Funny thing is I glanced through some of these during voting.  I looked at this shot, but did not recognize you. LOL I think you did a good job of getting the camera a bit higher, so that the flash from the camera causes the shadow to be slightly downword in direction.  I agree with others that the light is a bit harsh for this type of shot. The great thing with photoshop is that you can go to a hardware store and buy a haologen work light or two, and play with set ups for lighting and actually shoot with them.  your camera will have a setting for that type of light, or just shoot in black and white...have some fun with it. Great job. ', '2007-12-12 00:48:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4309541, 619411, 53465, '<td valign="top">thanks guys for the comments and all, im so happy<br/>i was dreaming about this day <br/>lol<br/> <br/>finally !<br/> <br/>:)</td>', 'thanks guys for the comments and all, im so happyi was dreaming about this day lol finally ! :)', '2007-12-12 00:52:35.000000', NULL, 0),
