(4310097, 617579, 67152, '<td valign="top">Tim- Cool stuff - Really creative use of water droplets.  After your tooth fairy shot, now I know why you put your SP behind glass and OOF! <br/> <br/>Congrats on another well deserved top 10</td>', 'Tim- Cool stuff - Really creative use of water droplets.  After your tooth fairy shot, now I know why you put your SP behind glass and OOF!  Congrats on another well deserved top 10', '2007-12-12 07:35:26.000000', NULL, 0);
