(4310158, 617905, 51269, '<td valign="top">Hey Deb- I knew you ! Grand finish- the eyes indeed are the windows to the soul-yours are gentle and beautiful, lovely SP.  :)</td>', 'Hey Deb- I knew you ! Grand finish- the eyes indeed are the windows to the soul-yours are gentle and beautiful, lovely SP.  :)', '2007-12-12 08:00:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4310161, 617905, 66597, '<td valign="top">Yep Deb, I got it right, I was pretty sure this was you. This is absolutely stunning, especially considering you were up against all those people with uber-expensive lighting kits, softboxes, etc. etc. I''m in awe of your talent, and what you accomplish with nothing but your camera. Not even a tripod! Incredible.</td>', 'Yep Deb, I got it right, I was pretty sure this was you. This is absolutely stunning, especially considering you were up against all those people with uber-expensive lighting kits, softboxes, etc. etc. I''m in awe of your talent, and what you accomplish with nothing but your camera. Not even a tripod! Incredible.', '2007-12-12 08:01:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4310162, 619791, 67152, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the ribbon.  An extremely fun, creative, quirky and technically excellent image.</td>', 'Congrats on the ribbon.  An extremely fun, creative, quirky and technically excellent image.', '2007-12-12 08:01:38.000000', NULL, 0),
