(4310237, 619910, 30982, '<td valign="top">I can''t quite see where your fingers are - need a bit higher resolution on the shot (or better eyes on my part.)  I do like this, though.  Works quite well, even without the eyes.  And I still don''t understand calculations.  Other than the quadratic - that one I remember.</td>', 'I can''t quite see where your fingers are - need a bit higher resolution on the shot (or better eyes on my part.)  I do like this, though.  Works quite well, even without the eyes.  And I still don''t understand calculations.  Other than the quadratic - that one I remember.', '2007-12-12 08:20:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4310244, 619785, 66597, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your first ribbon in only your second challenge - seems you have that Icelandic blood, all right :-) And of course congrats on beating Larus. Here''s to many more ribbons and look forward to seeing more of your work!</td>', 'Congrats on your first ribbon in only your second challenge - seems you have that Icelandic blood, all right :-) And of course congrats on beating Larus. Here''s to many more ribbons and look forward to seeing more of your work!', '2007-12-12 08:25:20.000000', NULL, 0),
