(4310263, 618741, 30982, '<td valign="top">Gave this an 8 - freakin'' awesome!  Well, that, and you''re gorgeous, which really really helps.  The lighting, the pose, the clarity, the DOF, and especially the processing to leave just that bit of color in your eyes are all excellent!  This should have beat the pants off of mine, by the way.  I had it pegged it for top 10.</td>', 'Gave this an 8 - freakin'' awesome!  Well, that, and you''re gorgeous, which really really helps.  The lighting, the pose, the clarity, the DOF, and especially the processing to leave just that bit of color in your eyes are all excellent!  This should have beat the pants off of mine, by the way.  I had it pegged it for top 10.', '2007-12-12 08:32:01.000000', NULL, 0),
