(4310281, 619944, 72894, '<td valign="top">Well I wish I wouldn''t have been away so I could have voted. I agree with many of the posts below. Depth of Field is my biggest gripe. Both eyes in focus as well as your lips would make this just amazing. You''re a striking woman and a powerful presence. Do us all a favor and try again with this very picture. Try out all of the suggestions and then post them for us to see. You can post them in the forum I imagine, if not I will happily help you find web space for it. Good Job though, really.<br/> <br/>Linc<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-12-12 08:42:31.</i></td>', 'Well I wish I wouldn''t have been away so I could have voted. I agree with many of the posts below. Depth of Field is my biggest gripe. Both eyes in focus as well as your lips would make this just amazing. You''re a striking woman and a powerful presence. Do us all a favor and try again with this very picture. Try out all of the suggestions and then post them for us to see. You can post them in the forum I imagine, if not I will happily help you find web space for it. Good Job though, really. Linc', '2007-12-12 08:41:22.000000', '2007-12-12 08:42:31.000000', 0),
