(4311690, 619411, 53465, '<td valign="top">hi fellas.<br/> <br/>thanks for the support, <br/> <br/>well here it is, many are going to be disapointment with this:<br/>pp was desaturate red tones , my face was red . then dodge and burn and finally sharpen.<br/> <br/>the hdr look is cause i sub exposed the sky 2 steps to mke it darker. oh and i also used a polarizer<br/>the lightning is he key mighty dpc friends.<br/>lets spend or money on lightning!!</td>', 'hi fellas. thanks for the support,  well here it is, many are going to be disapointment with this:pp was desaturate red tones , my face was red . then dodge and burn and finally sharpen. the hdr look is cause i sub exposed the sky 2 steps to mke it darker. oh and i also used a polarizerthe lightning is he key mighty dpc friends.lets spend or money on lightning!!', '2007-12-12 18:10:17.000000', NULL, 0),
