(4312034, 619478, 67697, '<td valign="top">I''m disappointed this scored so low.  I loved this.  The story I get from it is of one who is taking a moment to close their eyes, breathe in the cold air, while at the same time enjoying the moment of silence that only a blanketed night can provide.  Probably more than you intended, lol, but this is what I see!</td>', 'I''m disappointed this scored so low.  I loved this.  The story I get from it is of one who is taking a moment to close their eyes, breathe in the cold air, while at the same time enjoying the moment of silence that only a blanketed night can provide.  Probably more than you intended, lol, but this is what I see!', '2007-12-12 22:38:50.000000', NULL, 0),
