(4312096, 619331, 5822, '<td valign="top">You was robbed. Deep and powerful. Strength and vulnerability. Expressive and reflective. Lighting is perfect. Great use of your arms and negative space in framing. A small distraction is the bracelet. <i>The best in this challenge.</i><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-12-13 00:23:48.</i></td>', 'You was robbed. Deep and powerful. Strength and vulnerability. Expressive and reflective. Lighting is perfect. Great use of your arms and negative space in framing. A small distraction is the bracelet. The best in this challenge.', '2007-12-12 23:51:43.000000', '2007-12-13 00:23:48.000000', 0),
