(4312190, 619440, 30982, '<td valign="top">I really enjoyed coming upon this in the challenge, and to be honest, didn''t recognize you!  Seems from the comments I wasn''t the only one that got a kick out it!</td>', 'I really enjoyed coming upon this in the challenge, and to be honest, didn''t recognize you!  Seems from the comments I wasn''t the only one that got a kick out it!', '2007-12-13 01:17:03.000000', NULL, 0),
