(4312199, 619951, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh!  And you thought you were going for the brown... silly man!  Nice finish, nice portrait!</td>', 'Heh!  And you thought you were going for the brown... silly man!  Nice finish, nice portrait!', '2007-12-13 01:21:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4312202, 617971, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh!  Love your comments..  And this is a very good portrait!  I''d say you very much achieved your goal of focusing on the eyes - they definitely grab the viewer and pull them in - and they''re gorgeous eyes, too.  Very nice work!</td>', 'Heh!  Love your comments..  And this is a very good portrait!  I''d say you very much achieved your goal of focusing on the eyes - they definitely grab the viewer and pull them in - and they''re gorgeous eyes, too.  Very nice work!', '2007-12-13 01:24:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4312203, 619619, 30982, '<td valign="top">I applaud the lack of studio.  :-)  A quirky and quite intriguing shot - I''m terribly envious of your very well-deserved Posthumous Blue!</td>', 'I applaud the lack of studio.  :-)  A quirky and quite intriguing shot - I''m terribly envious of your very well-deserved Posthumous Blue!', '2007-12-13 01:26:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4312205, 619846, 30982, '<td valign="top">Jeb - this is pretty darn cool!  What works especially well for me is the busy pattern of the wallpaper behind contrasted with the plainness of the wrap on your face.</td>', 'Jeb - this is pretty darn cool!  What works especially well for me is the busy pattern of the wallpaper behind contrasted with the plainness of the wrap on your face.', '2007-12-13 01:28:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4312207, 619954, 30982, '<td valign="top">Mega props for shooting in the shower!  And as I said during voting, I really do like the blending into the wall part.</td>', 'Mega props for shooting in the shower!  And as I said during voting, I really do like the blending into the wall part.', '2007-12-13 01:31:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4312213, 618162, 36619, '<td valign="top">happy birthday! this was a gorgeous entry, you are certainly defying your age well. ;)</td>', 'happy birthday! this was a gorgeous entry, you are certainly defying your age well. ;)', '2007-12-13 01:32:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4312215, 619517, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good pose, good props (love the duct tape on the case).  I think it''s probably already been mentioned that the lighting is a bit harsh - lemme read...  Yep.  Someone suggested shoplights - those are pretty handy (but they get hot!) or see if you can find a good urban setting for a shot like this.  I much prefer using natural light when I can - mostly because I don''t have any fancy studio lights but also because it makes shots more "real" to me.  Good job getting yourself in focus - that''s one of the hardest things to do with a self-portrait!</td>', 'Good pose, good props (love the duct tape on the case).  I think it''s probably already been mentioned that the lighting is a bit harsh - lemme read...  Yep.  Someone suggested shoplights - those are pretty handy (but they get hot!) or see if you can find a good urban setting for a shot like this.  I much prefer using natural light when I can - mostly because I don''t have any fancy studio lights but also because it makes shots more "real" to me.  Good job getting yourself in focus - that''s one of the hardest things to do with a self-portrait!', '2007-12-13 01:35:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4312219, 617703, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very good composition and a creative execution of the challenge!  Just needed a touch more light, methinks.</td>', 'Very good composition and a creative execution of the challenge!  Just needed a touch more light, methinks.', '2007-12-13 01:38:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4312224, 619830, 30982, '<td valign="top">I think you got pretty close to what you were trying to do!  My one suggestion would be to wear a shirt that does show up just a bit, to prevent the "floating head" syndrome.  And perhaps just a wee bit more light on the lit side, with a reflector on the unlit side to give a hit of shape to that side of the face.  Or not.  :-)</td>', 'I think you got pretty close to what you were trying to do!  My one suggestion would be to wear a shirt that does show up just a bit, to prevent the "floating head" syndrome.  And perhaps just a wee bit more light on the lit side, with a reflector on the unlit side to give a hit of shape to that side of the face.  Or not.  :-)', '2007-12-13 01:41:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4312248, 618896, 35321, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 7, and would have scored it a little higher if it were more precisely symmetrical (e.g. rotated about 2 degrees clockwise).  Excellent lighting, and I like the noise.  Underrated, IMHO.</td>', 'I gave this a 7, and would have scored it a little higher if it were more precisely symmetrical (e.g. rotated about 2 degrees clockwise).  Excellent lighting, and I like the noise.  Underrated, IMHO.', '2007-12-13 02:04:22.000000', NULL, 0),
