(4312606, 618921, 3569, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments.  I was really surprized how bright a bounce flash of a closed palm could be.  My others were even more blown out.  Van</td>', 'Thanks for the comments.  I was really surprized how bright a bounce flash of a closed palm could be.  My others were even more blown out.  Van', '2007-12-13 10:22:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4312653, 619411, 50034, '<td valign="top"><b>Excellent photo!</b>  Has a slight artistic, painterly flair to it...similar to the animated effects of <b><u>The Polar Express</u></b>.  I really like this!  :)  An obvious <b>10</b>!  Congratulations!  :)</td>', 'Excellent photo!  Has a slight artistic, painterly flair to it...similar to the animated effects of The Polar Express.  I really like this!  :)  An obvious 10!  Congratulations!  :)', '2007-12-13 10:40:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(4312660, 619791, 50034, '<td valign="top"><b>Amazing Portrait!</b>  Color always seems to do well here, and you''ve made yours bright, but subtly so,...not overmuch!  Obviously, a great job on a true <b>10</b>!  :)</td>', 'Amazing Portrait!  Color always seems to do well here, and you''ve made yours bright, but subtly so,...not overmuch!  Obviously, a great job on a true 10!  :)', '2007-12-13 10:44:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4312681, 618243, 50034, '<td valign="top"><b>Excellent, Preacher!</b>  To get your compliment, I will have to pull from a couple of American sitcoms of the past four decades.  That being said, Congratulations, for you appear to have really <i><b>"Flipped Your Wilson!"</b></i>       :}</td>', 'Excellent, Preacher!  To get your compliment, I will have to pull from a couple of American sitcoms of the past four decades.  That being said, Congratulations, for you appear to have really "Flipped Your Wilson!"       :}', '2007-12-13 10:52:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4312689, 619309, 50034, '<td valign="top"><b>LOL!</b>  Great sense of humor or as I often get..."sense-less humor."  Great concept!  "10"  :)</td>', 'LOL!  Great sense of humor or as I often get..."sense-less humor."  Great concept!  "10"  :)', '2007-12-13 10:57:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4312696, 619415, 50034, '<td valign="top"><b>Your photo illustrates perfectly the concept of the title.</b>  Sadly, however, concept art doesn''t score well on DPC!  (I should know!)  But if it comforts you at all, just know that there are those of us here who understand, and truly respect the social and political statements photographers, like us, try to make with our photographs.<br/> <br/>Therefore, <b>STAY THE COURSE!</b>  Our job is Truth, not popularity!  :)       "10"<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-12-13 11:03:56.</i></td>', 'Your photo illustrates perfectly the concept of the title.  Sadly, however, concept art doesn''t score well on DPC!  (I should know!)  But if it comforts you at all, just know that there are those of us here who understand, and truly respect the social and political statements photographers, like us, try to make with our photographs. Therefore, STAY THE COURSE!  Our job is Truth, not popularity!  :)       "10"', '2007-12-13 11:02:27.000000', '2007-12-13 11:03:56.000000', 0),
(4312706, 619851, 50034, '<td valign="top">Great way to have Life imitate advertising!  Great way to make the earplugs and cord stand out!  Sorry that avant garde doesn''t "sell" well on DPC, but I understand your concept.  Pretty Cool!  :)</td>', 'Great way to have Life imitate advertising!  Great way to make the earplugs and cord stand out!  Sorry that avant garde doesn''t "sell" well on DPC, but I understand your concept.  Pretty Cool!  :)', '2007-12-13 11:07:15.000000', NULL, 0),
