(4315595, 618715, 60195, '<td valign="top">Highly under-rated. I really can''t put my finger on it... but there''s just something about this that keeps me coming back to look again.  I guess I would have to call this: <i>Seductive</i>.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-12-15 02:57:37.</i></td>', 'Highly under-rated. I really can''t put my finger on it... but there''s just something about this that keeps me coming back to look again.  I guess I would have to call this: Seductive.', '2007-12-15 02:53:11.000000', '2007-12-15 02:57:37.000000', 0),
