(4317662, 619956, 64994, '<td valign="top">AWESOME SHOT!!!</td>', 'AWESOME SHOT!!!', '2007-12-16 23:27:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4317818, 619933, 64994, '<td valign="top">Cool shot! I like it! A fellow Star Wars fan!!! lol. I set my lens focus at 3 feet and then measured out a piece of string so I knew exactly where 3 feet was from my lens and shot mine that way. Great shot!! Love the expression!! Thanks for the comment!!<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'Cool shot! I like it! A fellow Star Wars fan!!! lol. I set my lens focus at 3 feet and then measured out a piece of string so I knew exactly where 3 feet was from my lens and shot mine that way. Great shot!! Love the expression!! Thanks for the comment!! Jack', '2007-12-17 00:29:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4317892, 619793, 64994, '<td valign="top">Kindred spirits!! I like this shot very well, I love this sort of disembodied face shot (obviously!!) and the dramatic effect that goes with it, I know the focus hurt your score on this one but I, like Posthumous, really like the old horror movie feel it has! Great shot!! Don''t be discouraged by the score, Great idea and execution!!!<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'Kindred spirits!! I like this shot very well, I love this sort of disembodied face shot (obviously!!) and the dramatic effect that goes with it, I know the focus hurt your score on this one but I, like Posthumous, really like the old horror movie feel it has! Great shot!! Don''t be discouraged by the score, Great idea and execution!!! Jack', '2007-12-17 00:54:52.000000', NULL, 0),
