(4326440, 619288, 63269, '<td valign="top">The delicacy of the crystal clear details and the light is beautiful. Well done. I wish the background was a little more defined, or perhaps just simply completely dark. It''s a little confusing at first glance. Otherwise, this is nice!</td>', 'The delicacy of the crystal clear details and the light is beautiful. Well done. I wish the background was a little more defined, or perhaps just simply completely dark. It''s a little confusing at first glance. Otherwise, this is nice!', '2007-12-20 15:48:10.000000', NULL, 0),
