(4327389, 619959, 45631, '<td valign="top">Loved this.  One of only a few ten scores for this challenge.  Really thought it would have done much better than this. I would love to know how you did this. PM me if you''ll tell.</td>', 'Loved this.  One of only a few ten scores for this challenge.  Really thought it would have done much better than this. I would love to know how you did this. PM me if you''ll tell.', '2007-12-21 03:18:03.000000', NULL, 0),
