(4328847, 619534, 85886, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Dirt_Diver:</b></div><hr/><i> Okay there are way too many of these shots. Let me ask you, what made you think of doing this shot? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I couldn''t come up with anything better!!  At the time my motorbike was in for a service so I couldn''t get out too far to shoot anything, so was restricted to home...and I don''t have any decent lighting at home, apart from an LED flashlight...so I used that and a bulb exposure and played around.  I''m going to try to shoot it again once I''ve got an off-the-camera flash sorted.  Ideally it''ll have three different expressioned faced on it, and all three faces will be sharp - but merged.</td>', 'Originally posted by Dirt_Diver: Okay there are way too many of these shots. Let me ask you, what made you think of doing this shot?   I couldn''t come up with anything better!!  At the time my motorbike was in for a service so I couldn''t get out too far to shoot anything, so was restricted to home...and I don''t have any decent lighting at home, apart from an LED flashlight...so I used that and a bulb exposure and played around.  I''m going to try to shoot it again once I''ve got an off-the-camera flash sorted.  Ideally it''ll have three different expressioned faced on it, and all three faces will be sharp - but merged.', '2007-12-21 16:30:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4329009, 619450, 63269, '<td valign="top">Awesome contrasts and tones!</td>', 'Awesome contrasts and tones!', '2007-12-21 18:12:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4329263, 619494, 3724, '<td valign="top">Beautiful accuracy to a "star photo" - very good. I have seen 16x20 lithos from late 40''s &amp; 50''s w/linen texture for this kind of a studio publicity image. A good condition original is quite expensive. This is a fun image, &amp; I think good work recreating this style. The star''s large and expressive signature is usually evident.</td>', 'Beautiful accuracy to a "star photo" - very good. I have seen 16x20 lithos from late 40''s & 50''s w/linen texture for this kind of a studio publicity image. A good condition original is quite expensive. This is a fun image, & I think good work recreating this style. The star''s large and expressive signature is usually evident.', '2007-12-21 22:54:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4329854, 617905, 40797, '<td valign="top">Way to go Deb!! This is Fantastic!!</td>', 'Way to go Deb!! This is Fantastic!!', '2007-12-22 12:36:11.000000', NULL, 0),
