(4330520, 619656, 60862, '<td valign="top">I think you did a nice job with this - I voted it a 7.  I like the lighting and how the guy seems exhausted from reading.  As for non-vertical verticals, the main effect to me is to make it look more ominous, as the bookshelf seems to be about to fall over on him.  Only you can decide if you like that or not.</td>', 'I think you did a nice job with this - I voted it a 7.  I like the lighting and how the guy seems exhausted from reading.  As for non-vertical verticals, the main effect to me is to make it look more ominous, as the bookshelf seems to be about to fall over on him.  Only you can decide if you like that or not.', '2007-12-22 21:56:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4330614, 619959, 60862, '<td valign="top">Way cool.  I could see this on a billboard.  Just love the sparkle of color in the otherwise B&amp;W image.</td>', 'Way cool.  I could see this on a billboard.  Just love the sparkle of color in the otherwise B&W image.', '2007-12-22 23:12:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4330694, 619715, 60862, '<td valign="top">I liked this shot, but kind of missed the self-portrait connection (my problem, not yours).  Aside from being a self-portrait, though, it''s a very interesting image.  What I so appreciate about you, Christian, is your pursuit of your own artistic style.</td>', 'I liked this shot, but kind of missed the self-portrait connection (my problem, not yours).  Aside from being a self-portrait, though, it''s a very interesting image.  What I so appreciate about you, Christian, is your pursuit of your own artistic style.', '2007-12-23 00:24:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4330700, 619846, 60862, '<td valign="top">Jeb, I''m back with a more serious comment.  Both as a self-portrait and also as a general portrait, this photo actually has a lot to say.  Whether you meant it or not, it tells a story about anonymity, about not feeling comfortable in one''s own skin, about being invisible to the throngs around you.</td>', 'Jeb, I''m back with a more serious comment.  Both as a self-portrait and also as a general portrait, this photo actually has a lot to say.  Whether you meant it or not, it tells a story about anonymity, about not feeling comfortable in one''s own skin, about being invisible to the throngs around you.', '2007-12-23 00:28:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4330704, 619954, 60862, '<td valign="top">I don''t mind the grain, and I like the composition.  I just wish you stood out a little more from the background.  Ah-HAH!  Enlightement lands on me like a ton of bricks.  Your title reflects how you blend in.  *smacks forehead* Now, is that a broad statement of how you feel in your corner of the world?  Like you adjust yourself to your surroundings?  I suggest taking this even further - obliterate the boundaries and leave only the slightest difference in shade, with your hair, eyes, nostrils, and lips the only things seriously darker than the wall.  Play around and share with Team Suck. :)</td>', 'I don''t mind the grain, and I like the composition.  I just wish you stood out a little more from the background.  Ah-HAH!  Enlightement lands on me like a ton of bricks.  Your title reflects how you blend in.  *smacks forehead* Now, is that a broad statement of how you feel in your corner of the world?  Like you adjust yourself to your surroundings?  I suggest taking this even further - obliterate the boundaries and leave only the slightest difference in shade, with your hair, eyes, nostrils, and lips the only things seriously darker than the wall.  Play around and share with Team Suck. :)', '2007-12-23 00:31:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4330711, 617703, 60862, '<td valign="top">I''m not crazy about the execution, but I do like the concept.  I think I''d prefer it with higher contrast and the red toned down to just subtly colored instead of garish.  But hey, it''s your shot - do what you like!</td>', 'I''m not crazy about the execution, but I do like the concept.  I think I''d prefer it with higher contrast and the red toned down to just subtly colored instead of garish.  But hey, it''s your shot - do what you like!', '2007-12-23 00:33:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4330905, 618243, 20941, '<td valign="top">I love this! Awesome idea and a very creative self portrait. Congrats on the 4th</td>', 'I love this! Awesome idea and a very creative self portrait. Congrats on the 4th', '2007-12-23 08:32:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(4331166, 619713, 51538, '<td valign="top">Bear Music does Bukowski is my take on this.  Dan_Cottle''s comment is very valid, IMO.  It is indeed a brave commenter to say that.  Nice to see some have the guts to make that type of comment around here.  There is some sort of repulsive inspiration in this photo though.  I can indeed learn something from it.  So thanks.  I''m glad you entered it.</td>', 'Bear Music does Bukowski is my take on this.  Dan_Cottle''s comment is very valid, IMO.  It is indeed a brave commenter to say that.  Nice to see some have the guts to make that type of comment around here.  There is some sort of repulsive inspiration in this photo though.  I can indeed learn something from it.  So thanks.  I''m glad you entered it.', '2007-12-23 13:44:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4331263, 619801, 88099, '<td valign="top">it is in my opinion a good photo, but I am a little surprised on how well recieved it was. i''m going to have to say that it has a lot to do with a beautiful face.</td>', 'it is in my opinion a good photo, but I am a little surprised on how well recieved it was. i''m going to have to say that it has a lot to do with a beautiful face.', '2007-12-23 15:23:09.000000', NULL, 0),
