(4336597, 619801, 31403, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by thetimeofnew:</b></div><hr/><i> it is in my opinion a good photo, but I am a little surprised on how well recieved it was. i''m going to have to say that it has a lot to do with a beautiful face. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>He took one of the three comments he''s made on this site to tell you you''re beautiful!  Dang!<br/> <br/>It''s a cool photo in lots of ways besides your pretty face FWIW - :-)</td>', 'Originally posted by thetimeofnew: it is in my opinion a good photo, but I am a little surprised on how well recieved it was. i''m going to have to say that it has a lot to do with a beautiful face.   He took one of the three comments he''s made on this site to tell you you''re beautiful!  Dang! It''s a cool photo in lots of ways besides your pretty face FWIW - :-)', '2007-12-26 16:33:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4337973, 619656, 70689, '<td valign="top">Post Challenge:<br/> <br/>Thanks all for the great comments. I agree with the comments on the reddish gray, shouldn´t have done that. It is also true that there is some pixelation near my face. That wall isn´t even, and with resizing came the pixelation. I should have taken care of it in PP.<br/> <br/>I was right about the crowds not loving this, but I am surprised to see there´s still quite a number of people that actually like this shot. I also liked the fact that I left people in wonder with the nonsense title. :P<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-12-27 06:43:38.</i></td>', 'Post Challenge: Thanks all for the great comments. I agree with the comments on the reddish gray, shouldn´t have done that. It is also true that there is some pixelation near my face. That wall isn´t even, and with resizing came the pixelation. I should have taken care of it in PP. I was right about the crowds not loving this, but I am surprised to see there´s still quite a number of people that actually like this shot. I also liked the fact that I left people in wonder with the nonsense title. :P', '2007-12-27 06:43:12.000000', '2007-12-27 06:43:38.000000', 0),
(4338360, 619810, 47483, '<td valign="top">I did recognized you during voting and i gave it 10. (along with many other 10s i gave in this challenge). But i did feel that you did not enter this challenge for winning it. And you were doing experiments with compositions. This is my belief based on your recent uploads. Which i feel is good thing because one of my complains about this site is that people who has won many ribbons still doing the same stuff just to win ribbons. So seeing you try new and different stuff is really good thing. I hope others may follow you and think about photography and art other than DPC-Matrix.</td>', 'I did recognized you during voting and i gave it 10. (along with many other 10s i gave in this challenge). But i did feel that you did not enter this challenge for winning it. And you were doing experiments with compositions. This is my belief based on your recent uploads. Which i feel is good thing because one of my complains about this site is that people who has won many ribbons still doing the same stuff just to win ribbons. So seeing you try new and different stuff is really good thing. I hope others may follow you and think about photography and art other than DPC-Matrix.', '2007-12-27 10:16:06.000000', NULL, 0),
