(4425651, 619801, 75034, '<td valign="top">What in heavens name were the 15 people thinking when they voted this below 5????? 13 4s are bad enough but the one and the two?? Are these people MAD or just NUTS?? This is absolutely beautiful and shouldn''t have gone below a 6. (IMHO) I like the DoF, it''s spot on and the lighting is perfect, just enough to make your eyes pop and your face glow with your natural beauty. This is very, very well done and should placed in the top three. Personally I don''t find anything bad about it.<br/> <br/>MAX!</td>', 'What in heavens name were the 15 people thinking when they voted this below 5????? 13 4s are bad enough but the one and the two?? Are these people MAD or just NUTS?? This is absolutely beautiful and shouldn''t have gone below a 6. (IMHO) I like the DoF, it''s spot on and the lighting is perfect, just enough to make your eyes pop and your face glow with your natural beauty. This is very, very well done and should placed in the top three. Personally I don''t find anything bad about it. MAX!', '2008-01-25 23:34:29.000000', NULL, 0),
